rulings: ["[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the targeted nonland permanent forever.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If there are no nonland permanents on the battlefield other than an Oblivion Ring, and the card it exiled was another Oblivion Ring, casting a third Oblivion Ring will result in an involuntary infinite loop that will end the game in a draw (unless someone chooses to break it by putting another nonland permanent onto the battlefield or destroying one of the Oblivion Rings, for example).'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything, but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled forever.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "If combat damage is dealt to players by multiple artifact creatures you control (including, perhaps, Sharding Sphinx itself), Sharding Sphinx\'s ability will trigger that many times. You\'ll get that many Thopter tokens. You\'ll get just one token per creature, no matter how much combat damage that creature dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "Knight of the White Orchid\'s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless any one of your opponents controls more lands than you, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control at least as many lands as each of your opponents by the time it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The Plains you search for doesn\'t have to be basic. For example, you could put a Sacred Foundry onto the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "The ability checks the targeted creature\'s power twice: when the creature becomes the target, and when the ability resolves. Once the ability resolves, it will continue to apply to the affected creature no matter what its power may become later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won\'t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it\'s sacrificed, if it\'s legendary and another legendary creature with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "The targeted player will discard two cards even if some or all of Blightning\'s damage is prevented or redirected."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities; they have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it. Skill Borrower will momentarily gain the activated abilities of artifact and creature cards revealed this way, but you won’t be able to activate those abilities while the effect is still happening.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re activating one of Skill Borrower’s activated abilities gained from that card, the ability will still be activated and will resolve normally even though Skill Borrower has lost that ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Skill Borrower may gain activated abilities that it can’t use. For example, if the top card of your library is an artifact or creature card with cycling, Skill Borrower will have cycling. However, since cycling can’t be activated from the battlefield, this won’t have any significant benefit. The same is true for unearth.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Activating a creature card’s unearth ability isn’t the same as casting the creature card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the creature card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'At the beginning of the end step, a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Stifle or Voidslime that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the creature will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won’t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the creature when it eventually leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it’s exiled instead — unless the spell or ability that’s causing the creature to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If it later returns the creature card to the battlefield (as Oblivion Ring or Flickerwisp might, for example), the creature card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you activate a card’s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Unearth grants haste to the creature that’s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the “exile” abilities is granted to that creature. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Activating a creature card’s unearth ability isn’t the same as casting the creature card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the creature card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'At the beginning of the end step, a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Stifle or Voidslime that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the creature will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won’t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the creature when it eventually leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Despite the appearance of the reminder text, the unearth abilities that Sedris grants are activated abilities of each individual creature card in your graveyard. They’re not activated abilities of Sedris.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it’s exiled instead — unless the spell or ability that’s causing the creature to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If it later returns the creature card to the battlefield (as Oblivion Ring or Flickerwisp might, for example), the creature card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you activate a card’s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Sedris may cause a creature card in your graveyard to have multiple unearth abilities. (For example, a Fatestitcher in your graveyard would have unearth {U} and unearth {2}{B}.) You may activate either of those abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Unearth grants haste to the creature that’s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the “exile” abilities is granted to that creature. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Activating a creature card’s unearth ability isn’t the same as casting the creature card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the creature card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'At the beginning of the end step, a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Stifle or Voidslime that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the creature will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won’t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the creature when it eventually leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it’s exiled instead — unless the spell or ability that’s causing the creature to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If it later returns the creature card to the battlefield (as Oblivion Ring or Flickerwisp might, for example), the creature card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you activate a card’s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Unearth grants haste to the creature that’s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the “exile” abilities is granted to that creature. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Scourge Devil’s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves, including Scourge Devil itself. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +1/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Activating a creature card’s unearth ability isn’t the same as casting the creature card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the creature card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'At the beginning of the end step, a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Stifle or Voidslime that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the creature will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won’t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the creature when it eventually leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it’s exiled instead — unless the spell or ability that’s causing the creature to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If it later returns the creature card to the battlefield (as Oblivion Ring or Flickerwisp might, for example), the creature card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you activate a card’s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Unearth grants haste to the creature that’s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the “exile” abilities is granted to that creature. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Although Lich’s Mirror has you draw a hand of seven cards and sets your life total to 20, this isn’t a game restart. You can’t take a mulligan if you don’t like your new hand of cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Any abilities that trigger when the permanents leave the battlefield will be put on the stack after Lich’s Mirror’s entire effect has been applied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "As part of Lich\'s Mirror\'s effect, it typically shuffles itself into your library. If it does, that means that if you\'d lose the game *again* immediately after its effect is finished, it can\'t help you a second time. This can occur in a few different ways. For example: -- You have ten or more poison counters. Lich\'s Mirror doesn\'t remove poison counters. If you\'d lose the game this way, you\'ll do what Lich\'s Mirror says, then you\'ll lose the game the next time state-based actions are checked. -- Your life total is 0 or less and an effect says that you can\'t gain life. Since your life total can\'t be raised, it stays at whatever it is rather than becoming 20, and you\'ll lose the game the next time state-based actions are checked. -- The number of nontoken permanents you own plus the number of cards in your hand, graveyard, and library is less than seven. When you try to draw seven cards as part of Lich\'s Mirror\'s effect, you\'ll be unable to complete at least one of those draws and you\'ll lose the game the next time state-based actions are checked. -- You control *but don\'t own* a permanent such as Immortal Coil with a triggered ability that causes you to lose the game when a certain game state happens (also known as a “state trigger”), and the condition that causes the “lose the game” ability to trigger hasn\'t changed. If you owned the permanent, Lich\'s Mirror would shuffle it into your library. In this case, however, it remains on the battlefield and its ability will trigger again."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'For your life total to become 20, you actually gain or lose the necessary amount of life. Keep in mind that you may have a negative life total when this happens. For example, if your life total is -4 when you would lose the game, Lich’s Mirror’s effect will cause you to gain 24 life. Other cards that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell causes you to lose the game the next time state-based actions are checked (by dealing damage to you greater than your life total, for example), that spell will already be in the graveyard by the time Lich’s Mirror’s effect happens. If it’s in your graveyard, it will be shuffled into your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If all the players remaining in a game would lose simultaneously but one of them controls Lich’s Mirror, that player does what Lich’s Mirror says instead of losing, and everyone else loses. As a result, the controller of Lich’s Mirror wins the game because all of their opponents have lost. (If Lich’s Mirror weren’t in the picture, then the game would be a draw.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If you can’t lose the game (for example, you control a Platinum Angel), Lich’s Mirror won’t do anything.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If you control *but don’t own* Lich’s Mirror, Lich’s Mirror itself will still be on the battlefield after its effect is finished. If you would lose the game again for any of the reasons above, Lich’s Mirror has its effect again . . . and again . . . and again. An involuntary infinite loop will be created, and the game will end in a draw. (In the case of the triggered ability example given last in the list above, it’s possible that a player could cause the loop to end while the ability is on the stack. None of the loops caused by state-based actions can be stopped at all.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If, during a check of state-based actions, you’d lose the game at the same time a creature you own would be put into your graveyard (due to an Earthquake for 10 or combat damage dealt to both you and the creature, for example), that creature’s controller has a choice to make. The state-based actions rule is trying to simultaneously (a) shuffle that creature card into your library (due to Lich’s Mirror’s replacement effect) and (b) put it into your graveyard. Only one of those things can happen. The creature’s controller chooses which one. If the creature is put into your graveyard, it isn’t shuffled into your library. Abilities that trigger when that creature is put into a graveyard will trigger only if that option is chosen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If, during a check of state-based actions, you’d lose the game for multiple reasons (for example, if you were at 1 life and had one card in your library, then Night’s Whisper caused you to draw two cards and lose 2 life), a single Lich’s Mirror will replace all of them. You’ll do what Lich’s Mirror says just once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "Lich\'s Mirror replaces the game-loss event if you would lose the game in the following ways: -- As a state-based action for having 0 or less life. -- As a state-based action for having tried to draw a card from an empty library since the last time state-based actions were checked. -- As a state-based action for having ten or more poison counters (though this isn’t that helpful; see below). -- Because an ability (such as the one from Immortal Coil) states that you do so."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Lich’s Mirror doesn’t affect spells on the stack, cards that have been exiled, or permanents you control but don’t own. They’ll stay where they are. Spells on the stack will then resolve as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Lich’s Mirror has no effect if a spell or ability (such as the one from Helix Pinnacle) states that a player “wins the game.” If a player wins the game, the game ends immediately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Lich’s Mirror has no effect if you concede the game. If you concede, you’ll lose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Lich’s Mirror shuffles permanents you own into your library, regardless of who controls them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Lich’s Mirror shuffles tokens you own into your library, too. The tokens you own will leave play. However, there’s no point to physically shuffling tokens into your library because you can’t draw them as part of Lich’s Mirror’s effect and they’ll cease to exist immediately afterwards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A token’s owner is the player under whose control it entered the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, if your team would lose the game and you control Lich’s Mirror, your team won’t lose. Instead, you’ll do what Lich’s Mirror says and your teammate won’t do anything. This is true even if the reason your team would lose is because your teammate tried to draw a card with an empty library or was affected by an ability that said they lost the game. Your life total (which is the same as your team’s life total) becomes 20. Your team’s life total is adjusted by the amount of life you gain or lose as a result of this, which basically means your team’s life total becomes 20.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Any permanent that’s an artifact or a land won’t be destroyed, regardless of what other card types it may have.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'As the token is created, it checks the printed values of the creature it’s copying, as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won’t copy counters on the creature, nor will it copy other effects that have changed the creature’s power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the creature that caused Minion Reflector’s ability to trigger has already left the battlefield by the time the ability resolves, you can still pay {2}. If you do, you’ll still put a token onto the battlefield. That token has the copiable values of the characteristics of that nontoken creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The copiable values of the token’s characteristics are the same as the copiable values of the characteristics of the creature it’s copying, plus haste and “At end of turn, sacrifice this permanent.” That means if something becomes a copy of the token, it will also have haste and it will also have to be sacrificed at the end of the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Caldera Hellion will deal 3 damage to itself (as well as to each other creature) when its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. This damage will be lethal if Caldera Hellion hasn’t devoured any creatures and its toughness hasn’t been increased by any other means.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with devour are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you may use each one’s devour ability. A creature you already control can be devoured by only one of them, however. (In other words, you can’t sacrifice the same creature to satisfy multiple devour abilities.) All creatures devoured this way are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast this as a spell, you choose how many and which creatures to devour as part of the resolution of that spell. (It can’t be countered at this point.) The same is true of a spell or ability that lets you put a creature with devour onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose not to sacrifice any creatures for the Devour ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only creatures that are already on the battlefield. If a creature with devour and another creature are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, the creature with devour can’t devour that other creature. The creature with devour also can’t devour itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Casting Qasali Ambusher as described in its second ability still uses the stack. The spell can be countered.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'For you to cast Qasali Ambusher as described in its second ability, a creature has to be attacking *you*. If creatures are attacking only planeswalkers, you won’t be able to cast Qasali Ambusher this way.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you want to cast Qasali Ambusher by using its second ability, you don’t necessarily have to do it during the declare attackers step. You can do it later in combat (including all the way up through the end of combat step) as long as there’s still a creature attacking you. Of course, if you cast Qasali Ambusher later than the declare attackers step, it won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Qasali Ambusher’s second ability is looking for lands with the subtypes Forest and Plains. Those lands don’t need to be named Forest and Plains. It’s okay if both subtypes are from the same land (such as Savannah or Temple Garden).'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you’re playing a Two-Headed Giant game and a creature is attacking your teammate, you won’t be able to cast Qasali Ambusher this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Coma Veil may target and may enchant an untapped artifact or creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Converted mana cost takes into account only the mana symbols printed in the upper right corner of the card. Manaplasm doesn’t care about additional costs, alternative costs, cost-reduction effects, or what you actually paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'While a spell with {X} in its cost is on the stack, its converted mana cost takes the chosen value of X into account. For example, if you cast Blaze (a spell with the mana cost {X}{R}) and choose a value of 5 for that X, then your Manaplasm will get +6/+6 until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cradle of Vitality triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Deathgreeter or 8 life from Soul’s Grace. You pay the cost just once, but the targeted creature will get a number of counters equal to the amount of life you gained.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You choose a target when the ability triggers. You don’t choose whether to pay {1}{W} until the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures you control with lifelink deal damage simultaneously, each instance is a single life-gain event and the ability will trigger separately for each of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Stifle, for example, or if all its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve and you’ll draw a card.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can cycle this card even if there are no targets for the triggered ability. That’s because the cycling ability itself has no targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Each time a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, check whether Blood Cultist had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. (This includes combat damage.) If so, Blood Cultist’s second ability will trigger. It doesn’t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If Blood Cultist and a creature it dealt damage to are both put into a graveyard at the same time, Blood Cultist’s ability will trigger, but it will do nothing when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Each time a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, check whether Vein Drinker had dealt damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Vein Drinker’s third ability will trigger. It doesn’t matter whether the damage was combat damage or not. It also doesn’t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If Vein Drinker’s first ability causes Vein Drinker and the targeted creature to deal lethal damage to each other, they’ll be destroyed at the same time. Vein Drinker’s triggered ability will trigger, but it will have been put into a graveyard before it would receive any counters. The ability will do nothing when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'When the first ability resolves, if the targeted creature is no longer on the battlefield, the ability doesn’t resolve for having no legal targets. No damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'When the first ability resolves, if the targeted creature is still on the battlefield but Vein Drinker is not, Vein Drinker will still deal damage equal to its power as it last existed on the battlefield to the targeted creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Effects that tell a player to reveal cards from a library or look at cards from the top of a library will still work. Only effects that use the word “search” will fail.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If an effect says “Search your library . . . Then shuffle your library,” the search effect fails, but you will have to shuffle.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If an effect says “You may search your library . . . If you do, shuffle your library,” you can’t choose to search, so you won’t shuffle.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Since players can’t search, players won’t be able to find any cards in a library. The effect applies to all players and all libraries. If a spell or ability’s effect has other parts that don’t depend on searching for or finding cards, they will still work normally.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted abilities will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted bonuses last until end of turn. If an effect creates an additional combat phase during your turn, a creature that attacked alone during the first combat phase will still have its exalted bonuses in that new phase. If a creature attacks alone during the second combat phase, all your exalted abilities will trigger again.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures, but then all but one are removed from combat, your exalted abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you declare exactly one creature as an attacker, each exalted ability on each permanent you control (including, perhaps, the attacking creature itself) will trigger. The bonuses are given to the attacking creature, not to the permanent with exalted. Ultimately, the attacking creature will wind up with +1/+1 for each of your exalted abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, a creature “attacks alone” if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker by your entire team. If you control that attacking creature, your exalted abilities will trigger but your teammate’s exalted abilities won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Some effects put creatures onto the battlefield attacking. Since those creatures were never declared as attackers, they’re ignored by exalted abilities. They won’t cause exalted abilities to trigger. If any exalted abilities have already triggered (because exactly one creature was declared as an attacker), those abilities will resolve as normal even though there may now be multiple attackers.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Battlegrace Angel could cause a creature to have multiple instances of lifelink. For example, a creature you control that already has lifelink could attack alone while you control Battlegrace Angel, or a creature you control could attack alone while you control more than one Battlegrace Angel. If a creature has multiple instances of lifelink, they are redundant. You’ll still only gain life equal to the damage dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted abilities will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted bonuses last until end of turn. If an effect creates an additional combat phase during your turn, a creature that attacked alone during the first combat phase will still have its exalted bonuses in that new phase. If a creature attacks alone during the second combat phase, all your exalted abilities will trigger again.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures, but then all but one are removed from combat, your exalted abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you declare exactly one creature as an attacker, each exalted ability on each permanent you control (including, perhaps, the attacking creature itself) will trigger. The bonuses are given to the attacking creature, not to the permanent with exalted. Ultimately, the attacking creature will wind up with +1/+1 for each of your exalted abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, a creature “attacks alone” if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker by your entire team. If you control that attacking creature, your exalted abilities will trigger but your teammate’s exalted abilities won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Some effects put creatures onto the battlefield attacking. Since those creatures were never declared as attackers, they’re ignored by exalted abilities. They won’t cause exalted abilities to trigger. If any exalted abilities have already triggered (because exactly one creature was declared as an attacker), those abilities will resolve as normal even though there may now be multiple attackers.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The creature you target with the last ability will become tapped before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted abilities will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted bonuses last until end of turn. If an effect creates an additional combat phase during your turn, a creature that attacked alone during the first combat phase will still have its exalted bonuses in that new phase. If a creature attacks alone during the second combat phase, all your exalted abilities will trigger again.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures, but then all but one are removed from combat, your exalted abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you declare exactly one creature as an attacker, each exalted ability on each permanent you control (including, perhaps, the attacking creature itself) will trigger. The bonuses are given to the attacking creature, not to the permanent with exalted. Ultimately, the attacking creature will wind up with +1/+1 for each of your exalted abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, a creature “attacks alone” if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker by your entire team. If you control that attacking creature, your exalted abilities will trigger but your teammate’s exalted abilities won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Some effects put creatures onto the battlefield attacking. Since those creatures were never declared as attackers, they’re ignored by exalted abilities. They won’t cause exalted abilities to trigger. If any exalted abilities have already triggered (because exactly one creature was declared as an attacker), those abilities will resolve as normal even though there may now be multiple attackers.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'First you choose a card to discard, then each other player in turn order chooses a card to discard, then all those cards are discarded simultaneously. No one sees what the other players are discarding before deciding which cards to discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'For the second ability, you choose the value of X when you activate it. You don’t look through your library until the ability resolves. (In other words, you can’t look through your library, decide what artifact card you want, and then determine what X is.) You can’t choose an X that’s greater than the number of loyalty counters on Tezzeret.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The first ability can target zero, one, or two artifacts. You may activate it with no targets just to put a loyalty counter on Tezzeret.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The third ability affects all artifacts you control, including artifacts that are already creatures.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The third ability causes artifacts you control to become creatures in addition to their other card types.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature is subject to the “summoning sickness” rule: It can only attack, and its {T} abilities can only be activated, if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The effect from the ability overwrites other effects that set power and/or toughness if and only if those effects existed before the ability resolved. It will not overwrite effects that modify power or toughness (whether from a static ability, counters, or a resolved spell or ability), nor will it overwrite effects that set power and toughness which come into existence after the ability resolves. Effects that switch the creature’s power and toughness are always applied after any other power or toughness changing effects, including this one, regardless of the order in which they are created.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'For your life total to become the appropriate number, you actually gain or lose the necessary amount of life. For example, if your life total is 20 and your library has thirty-two cards in it when Invincible Hymn resolves, Invincible Hymn will cause you to gain 12 life. Other cards that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with Invincible Hymn accordingly.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Invincible Hymn checks the number of cards in your library just once: when it resolves. It doesn’t continuously modify your life total as your library size changes.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Invincible Hymn will essentially set your team’s life total to the number of cards in your library. For example, suppose your team has 8 life and you have thirty cards in your library. Your life total (being the same as your team’s life total) changes from 8 life to 30 life, for a net gain of 22 life. Your team’s life total becomes 30 (22 + 8).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Gather Specimens affects both token creatures and nontoken creatures. It affects creatures that would enter the battlefield by any means. This includes, of course, creature spells that resolve. It also includes creatures put onto the battlefield as a result of a resolving spell (such as Call of the Herd or Zombify), resolving ability (such as Verdant Force’s ability or Doomed Necromancer’s ability), cost (such as Varchild’s War-Riders’s cumulative upkeep cost), replacement effect (such as the one created by Words of Wilding), or any other means.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Gather Specimens isn’t targeted. It affects creatures that would enter the battlefield under any opponent’s control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Gather Specimens won’t retroactively change the control of creatures that have already enter the battlefield that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If a creature spell controlled by an opponent would resolve, it resolves, but the creature enters the battlefield under your control instead of the opponent’s control. Choices made when casting that spell (such as whether it was kicked or the value of X in the spell’s cost) are remembered. Any “enters the battlefield” triggered abilities will trigger after the creature is on the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If the effect that puts a creature onto the battlefield also creates a delayed triggered ability, Gather Specimens doesn’t change who controls that ability. In the unearth example above, your opponent controls the ability that exiles the creature at the beginning of the end step. On the other hand, if the effect that puts a creature onto the battlefield grants a triggered ability to the creature (with “gains” or “has”), the player who controls the creature at the time the ability triggers will be the player who controls that ability. For example, if your opponent casts Makeshift Mannequin and you cast Gather Specimens in response, the creature will return to the battlefield under your control with a mannequin counter and it will have the ability “When this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it.” If the ability triggers, you’ll control it, so you’ll have to sacrifice the creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more players have each cast Gather Specimens during the same turn and a creature would enter the battlefield, the creature’s would-be controller (the controller of the creature spell, for example) chooses one of the applicable Gather Specimens to apply. Then the new would-be controller of the creature repeats this process among the remaining Gather Specimens, and so on, until there are no more possible Gather Specimens effects to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Some effects that put creatures onto the battlefield continue to affect those creatures later on. Although Gather Specimens changes whose control the creature enters the battlefield under, the rest of the effect works as normal. For example, if your opponent activates a creature card’s unearth ability and you cast Gather Specimens, that creature enters the battlefield under your control, but the rest of the unearth ability is unchanged. The creature has haste. It’s exiled at the beginning of the end step. If it would leave the battlefield, it’s exiled instead of being put anywhere else.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "The Gather Specimens replacement effect is applied before any other replacement effects that would also modify how the creature enters the battlefield. These are usually worded “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with.” For example, if your Gather Specimens has resolved, then the following things are true: -- If a creature with devour would enter the battlefield under an opponent\'s control, you choose and sacrifice your creatures as it enters the battlefield under your control. -- If Voice of All would enter the battlefield under an opponent\'s control, you choose a color as it enters the battlefield under your control. -- If Clone would enter the battlefield under an opponent\'s control, you choose which creature it copies as it enters the battlefield under your control. -- If a Wizard would enter the battlefield under an opponent\'s control and that player controls Sage of Fables, the Wizard will not enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it as it enters the battlefield under your control. -- If a Wizard would enter the battlefield under an opponent\'s control and you control Sage of Fables, the Wizard will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it as it enters the battlefield under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The above procedure means that if two opposing players have each cast Gather Specimens during the same turn and a creature would enter the battlefield under the control of one of them, it really will enter the battlefield under that player’s control. (The creature would enter the battlefield under player A’s control, so player B’s Gather Specimens affects it. Now that creature would enter the battlefield under player B’s control, so player A’s Gather Specimens affects it. Each replacement effect has now been used, so the creature will enter the battlefield under player A’s control.)\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Hindering Light can target a spell that has multiple targets, as long as at least one of those targets is you or a permanent you control.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose to target a spell that “can’t be countered.” If you do, the first part of Hindering Light’s effect won’t do anything, but you’ll still get to draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If Archdemon of Unx is the only non-Zombie creature you control when the triggered ability resolves, you’ll have to sacrifice it. You’ll still get a Zombie token.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you somehow control no non-Zombie creatures when the triggered ability resolves, you won’t have to sacrifice anything. You’ll still get a Zombie token.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If Carrion Thrash and another creature are put into a graveyard from the battlefield at the same time, you may target the other creature with Carrion Thrash’s ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You choose a target when the ability triggers. You decide whether to pay {2} when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If Realm Razer leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile all lands forever.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If Sigil of Distinction is attached to a creature when its equip ability is activated targeting a different creature, the first creature will immediately get a little smaller because a charge counter has been removed from Sigil of Distinction as a cost. Then, when the equip ability resolves, Sigil of Distinction will move to the new creature and the first creature will lose the entire bonus the Equipment was giving it.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Removing a charge counter from Sigil of Distinction is the only way to pay for its equip ability. If it has no charge counters on it, its equip ability can’t be activated.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If a spell targets multiple things, you can’t target it with Swerve, even if all but one of those targets has become illegal.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If a spell targets the same player or object multiple times, you can’t target it with Swerve.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast Swerve on a spell that targets a spell on the stack (like Cancel does, for example), you can’t change that spell’s target to itself. You can, however, change that spell’s target to Swerve. If you do, that spell won’t resolve when it tries to resolve because Swerve will have left the stack by then.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Swerve targets only the spell whose target will be changed. It doesn’t directly affect the original target of that spell or the new target of that spell.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You don’t choose the new target for the spell until Swerve resolves. You must change the target if possible. However, you can’t change the target to an illegal target. If there are no legal targets, the target isn’t changed. It doesn’t matter if the original target of that spell has somehow become illegal.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'An Aura spell on the stack targets the object or player which it will enchant upon entering the battlefield. Thus, an Aura spell is a “spell with a single target”, which means you may use Swerve to change that target. Doing so will cause it to enter the battlefield enchanting the new target rather than the original one.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If multiple Quietus Spikes trigger at the same time, that player loses half their life when the first ability resolves, then loses half of the remainder when the next ability resolves, and so on. The player does not lose the same amount each time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "That player loses half their life after combat damage has been subtracted from the player\'s life total. The amount of life the player loses is determined as the triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, after combat damage is dealt, Quietus Spike looks at that player\'s life total (which is the same as the team\'s life total) when determining how much life the team will lose, which basically means the team\'s life total is halved. Here\'s an example of the math: The team has 19 life, so the player has 19 life. Quietus Spike causes the team to lose 10 life (19 divided by 2, rounded up). The team\'s life total becomes 9 (19 minus 10)."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with devour are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you may use each one’s devour ability. A creature you already control can be devoured by only one of them, however. (In other words, you can’t sacrifice the same creature to satisfy multiple devour abilities.) All creatures devoured this way are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast this as a spell, you choose how many and which creatures to devour as part of the resolution of that spell. (It can’t be countered at this point.) The same is true of a spell or ability that lets you put a creature with devour onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The number of Saproling tokens created by the triggered ability is based on the number of +1/+1 counters on Mycoloth, not on the number of creatures Mycoloth devoured. It doesn’t matter where the +1/+1 counters came from.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose not to sacrifice any creatures for the Devour ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only creatures that are already on the battlefield. If a creature with devour and another creature are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, the creature with devour can’t devour that other creature. The creature with devour also can’t devour itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with devour are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you may use each one’s devour ability. A creature you already control can be devoured by only one of them, however. (In other words, you can’t sacrifice the same creature to satisfy multiple devour abilities.) All creatures devoured this way are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast this as a spell, you choose how many and which creatures to devour as part of the resolution of that spell. (It can’t be countered at this point.) The same is true of a spell or ability that lets you put a creature with devour onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose not to sacrifice any creatures for the Devour ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only creatures that are already on the battlefield. If a creature with devour and another creature are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, the creature with devour can’t devour that other creature. The creature with devour also can’t devour itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If one of the cards is Dryad Arbor (a creature land card), you may reveal Dryad Arbor and another land card or Dryad Arbor and another creature card.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may reveal a creature card, or you may reveal a land card, or you may reveal both a creature card and a land card.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the ability triggers and your opponent chooses not to pay 3 life, you must return the card to the battlefield, even if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the permanent that caused the ability to trigger leaves the graveyard before the ability resolves (because it’s a token and it ceased to exist, or because a spell or ability removed it from the graveyard), the ability will still resolve. The opponent will have the option to pay 3 life. But whether or not that player pays the life, nothing will be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whose graveyard the permanent is put into as long as an opponent controlled it when it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted card is removed from the graveyard before Shadowfeed resolves, Shadowfeed doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 3 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted card is removed from the graveyard before the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t get a Saproling token.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature becomes an illegal target before Call to Heel resolves, Call to Heel doesn’t resolve. No one draws a card.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The player who draws a card is the player who controls the creature when Call to Heel resolves. This may not be the player whose hand the creature is put into.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature becomes an illegal target by the time Sigil Blessing resolves, the entire spell won’t resolve. Your other creatures won’t get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the third ability is countered, but your graveyard is still empty, the ability will immediately trigger again.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Similarly, if the third ability resolves but you don’t lose the game for some reason (because you control Platinum Angel, perhaps), it will immediately trigger again if your graveyard is still empty. Immortal Coil + Platinum Angel + an empty graveyard is an involuntary infinite loop. Unless a player disrupts it, the game will end in a draw.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The first ability exiles two cards in your graveyard as a cost. You can’t activate this ability unless you have at least two cards in your graveyard. Exiling those two cards can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The second ability prevents all damage that would be dealt to you, regardless of how many cards are in your graveyard. For example, if you have three cards in your graveyard and would be dealt 5 damage, Immortal Coil prevents all 5 damage and exiles all the cards in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The third ability checks whether your graveyard is empty only at the time it triggers. Putting a card into your graveyard after that doesn’t help. You’ll lose the game when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when Blister Beetle enters the battlefield, it must target itself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If this spell is copied, the copy will have the same mode as the original.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "While the spell is on the stack, treat it as though its only text is the chosen mode. The other two modes are treated as though they don\'t exist. You don\'t choose targets for those modes."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. If you can\'t choose legal targets for any of the modes, you can\'t cast the spell."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If this spell is copied, the copy will have the same mode as the original.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'While the spell is on the stack, treat it as though its only text is the chosen mode. The other two modes are treated as though they don’t exist. You don’t choose targets for those modes.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. If you can’t choose legal targets for any of the modes, you can’t cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can pay additional costs, such as conspire costs and kicker costs.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'One of the piles may have zero cards in it if the opponent wishes.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The cards are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The cards in the pile that wasn’t chosen remain exiled. Likewise, any cards in the chosen pile that you can’t play or you choose not to play remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can play a land card from the chosen pile only if it’s your turn (which it probably is, since Brilliant Ultimatum is a sorcery) and you haven’t yet played a land this turn. That means that if there are two lands in the chosen pile, you’ll be able to play a maximum of one of them.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You play cards from the chosen pile as part of the resolution of Brilliant Ultimatum. You may play them in any order. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (such as creature or sorcery) are ignored. Other play restrictions are not (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”). You play all of the cards you like, putting land onto the battlefield and spells on the stack, then Brilliant Ultimatum finishes resolving and is put into your graveyard. The spells you cast this way will then resolve as normal, one at a time, in the opposite order that they were put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose a permanent whose name has been changed by an effect (for example, a Clone that’s copying another creature), you’ll search for a card with the new name, not one with the original name. Note that changing a land’s subtype doesn’t change its name.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose a permanent with no name, such as a face-down creature, no card in your library can be found with that name.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you find a card that isn’t a permanent card while searching (for example, you chose an Illusion token and find the split card Illusion/Reality), that card remains in your library.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The cards all enter the battlefield at the same time. If one of the cards that’s entering the battlefield is an Aura, it must enter the battlefield attached to a permanent already on the battlefield. It can’t enter the battlefield attached to another permanent entering the battlefield via Clarion Ultimatum. If an Aura can’t enter the battlefield this way, it remains in your library.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The five permanents you choose must all be different. However, some of them may have the same name as one another. For example, you may choose two Empyrial Archangels and three Plains. If you do, you search your library for up to two more Empyrial Archangels and up to three more Plains and put them onto the battlefield tapped.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'This spell has no targets. You don’t choose five permanents you control until Clarion Ultimatum resolves. If you control fewer than five permanents at that time, choose each permanent you do control.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You make just one search. (This could matter for cards like Aven Mindcensor, for example.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you control no Homunculi when the second ability resolves, nothing happens. There’s no penalty for failing to sacrifice a Homunculus.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The Homunculus you sacrifice due to the second ability isn’t limited to being a Homunculus token put onto the battlefield by Puppet Conjurer.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you control two Steelclad Serpents, they’ll enable each other to attack.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Multiple instances of first strike and trample are redundant.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The set of creatures affected is fixed as Titanic Ultimatum resolves.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature you control already has lifelink, Titanic Ultimatum will give it a second instance of lifelink; however, multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant. You still only gain life equal to the amount of damage dealt, regardless of how many instances of lifelink the creature has.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Sarkhan Vol’s first ability affects only creatures you control when that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may activate the first ability even if you control no creatures. Sarkhan Vol gains a loyalty counter, but the ability will have no effect.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may target any creature with the second ability, not just a creature an opponent controls. If you target a creature you already control, you’ll gain control of it (which will usually have no visible effect), it’ll untap, and it’ll gain haste until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Since Topan Ascetic’s activated ability doesn’t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap a creature (including Topan Ascetic itself) that hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began to pay the cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The ability checks that creature’s power only once: when that creature enters the battlefield. The trigger checks a creature’s initial power upon being put on the battlefield, so it will take into account counters that it enters the battlefield with and static abilities that may give it a continuous power boost once it’s on the battlefield (such as the one on Glorious Anthem). After the creature is already on the battlefield, boosting its power with a spell (such as Giant Growth), activated ability, or triggered ability won’t allow this ability to trigger; it’s too late by then. Once the ability triggers, it will resolve no matter what the creature’s power may become while the ability is on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The ability checks the targeted creature’s power twice: when the creature becomes the target, and when the ability resolves. Once the ability resolves, it will continue to apply to the affected creature no matter what its power may become later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The ability checks whether Sphinx Sovereign is tapped or untapped at the time the ability resolves. If Sphinx Sovereign is no longer on the battlefield by then, the ability checks whether Sphinx Sovereign was tapped or untapped at the time it left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The ability doesn’t target, so it checks the creatures’ powers only once: when the ability resolves. Once the ability resolves, it will continue to apply to the affected creatures no matter what their powers may become later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The enchanted land loses its existing land types and any abilities printed on it. It now has the ability to tap to add {R}, {G}, or {W} to its controller’s mana pool. Lush Growth doesn’t change the enchanted land’s name or whether it’s legendary or basic.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The first ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” That means (1) the ability won’t trigger at all unless you control a creature with power 5 or greater as your end step begins, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you don’t control a creature with power 5 or greater by the time it resolves. (It doesn’t have to be the same creature as the one that allowed the ability to trigger.) Power-boosting effects that last “until end of turn” will still be in effect when this kind of ability triggers and resolves. An ability like this will trigger a maximum of once per turn, no matter how many applicable creatures you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The first ability tracks the permanent, but not its controller. If the permanent changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step has come around, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may target any permanent with Ajani Vengeant’s first ability. It doesn’t have to be tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The number of cards in the targeted opponent’s hand is checked only when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The player you target doesn’t have to be the controller of the creature that was put into a graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect can reduce only the generic portion of the artifact spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of an artifact spell. Rather, it reduces the total cost of the spell, which is the amount you actually pay while casting it. The total cost takes into account additional or alternative costs."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'To activate the ability, you must sacrifice three different creatures. You can’t sacrifice just one three-colored creature, for example.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice multicolored creatures as part of the cost of the search ability. If you sacrifice a multicolored creature this way, specify which part of the cost that creature is satisfying.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice the Herald itself to help pay for the cost of its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice Protomatter Powder to return itself to the battlefield. First you choose the target (at which time it’s still on the battlefield), then you pay the costs (at which time you sacrifice it).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If you activate the ability multiple times during the same turn, Vectis Silencers will gain multiple instances of deathtouch; however, multiple instances of deathtouch are redundant. A creature dealt damage by a source with deathtouch is destroyed as a state-based action the next time they are checked, so a single regeneration effect will save it regardless of how many instances of deathtouch the source had at the time damage was dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The player who loses life is the player who controlled the creature when it was put into a graveyard. This may not be the player whose graveyard it was put into. That player loses life equal to the creature’s toughness as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The targeted opponent has two options: Let you have the three revealed cards or let you have five unknown cards. Note that if the opponent goes with the first option, you put cards into your hand rather than draw them (in case something like Hoofprints of the Stag cares about that), but if the opponent goes with the second option, you actually draw cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'This is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack, and it can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'While you’re casting a creature spell, that card is on the stack, so you can’t reveal it with Sacellum Godspeaker’s ability to produce mana. You can, however, activate this mana ability and reveal that creature card from your hand before you begin to cast the card as a spell.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can activate this ability even if you have no creature cards with power 5 or greater in your hand, or you have some but choose not to reveal any of them. In those cases, the ability won’t produce any mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'To activate the ability, you must sacrifice three different creatures. You can’t sacrifice just one three-colored creature, for example.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice multicolored creatures as part of the cost of the search ability. If you sacrifice a multicolored creature this way, specify which part of the cost that creature is satisfying.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice the Herald itself to help pay for the cost of its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Wild Nacatl’s abilities check for lands with the subtypes Mountain and Plains. Those lands don’t need to be named Mountain and Plains. Wild Nacatl will get both bonuses if those two subtypes are contained among the lands you control, even if they’re from the same land (such as Plateau or Sacred Foundry).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'X is equal to the power of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'X is equal to the power of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Soldier to activate the second ability. You’re not limited to just the Soldier tokens put onto the battlefield by the first ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You choose the target when the ability triggers. When the ability resolves, you choose a value for X and decide whether to pay {X}{R}. If you do decide to pay {X}{R}, it’s too late for any player to respond since the ability is already in the midst of resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose just the first mode (targeting a creature with flying), just the second mode (targeting a creature without flying), or both modes (targeting a creature with flying and a creature without flying). You can’t choose a mode unless there’s a legal target for it.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice Skeletal Kathari to pay for its own regeneration ability. If you do, however, it won’t regenerate. It’ll just end up in its owner’s graveyard as a result of the sacrifice.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may target a spell that “can’t be countered” with Punish Ignorance. If you do, the first part of Punish Ignorance’s effect won’t do anything, but the life-loss and life-gain effects will still work.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You must target three different permanents. If some of the permanents become illegal targets before the spell resolves, Violent Ultimatum will still destroy the rest of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Emblems behave similarly to enchantments: They have an ability that, in a general sense, continually affects the game. The primary difference between them is that emblems aren’t permanents and don’t exist on the battlefield. Nothing in the game can remove an emblem, simply because no other spell or ability references them. Once you get an emblem, you keep it for the rest of the game. Emblems have no color, name, card type, or other characteristics beyond the listed ability.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a permanent with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a permanent with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed, if it’s a creature whose toughness is 0 or less, or if it’s an Aura that’s either unattached or attached to something illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this as normal during your main phase, it will enter the battlefield and you’ll receive priority. If no abilities trigger because of this, you can activate its ability immediately, before any other player has a chance to remove it from the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "If you activate Relic of Progenitus\'s first ability, the targeted player chooses which card to exile. The choice is made as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "You can activate Relic of Progenitus\'s second ability even if no players have any cards in their graveyards. You\'ll still draw a card."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'All of the actions for Cruel Ultimatum are performed sequentially, in the order listed. Earlier actions may affect how you perform later actions. For example, if the opponent sacrifices a creature that they control but you own, it will end up in your graveyard. When Cruel Ultimatum lets you return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand, you can choose that one.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Cruel Ultimatum’s only target is an opponent. You don’t choose which creature card in your graveyard you’ll return to your hand until Cruel Ultimatum resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If, as Cruel Ultimatum begins to resolve, your opponent’s life total is 5 or less and you have two or fewer cards in your library, the game will result in a draw. Your opponent’s life total will drop to 0 or less, but Cruel Ultimatum must finish resolving completely before state-based actions are performed. You’ll then be forced to draw three cards and fail to draw one. When state-based actions are finally performed, you and your opponent will both lose the game at the same time, which means the game is a draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Goblin Assault’s second ability affects all Goblin creatures controlled by all players. It’s not limited to the tokens created with the first ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If multiple Stoic Angels are on the battlefield, their effects are redundant. Each player will still be able to untap no more than one creature during their untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Noncreature permanents will untap as normal during their controllers’ untap steps.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The two targets may be the same creature or they may be different creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'You may choose to find zero, one, or two creature cards in your library. Each card you find must have converted mana cost 1 or less.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Magma Spray\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature even if Magma Spray deals no damage to it (due to a prevention effect) or Magma Spray deals damage to a different creature (due to a redirection effect)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You get the token created by Skeletonize\'s delayed triggered ability regardless of who controlled the creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "A creature that\'s both a Skeleton and a Zombie will get the bonus only once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Skeleton or Zombie you control may become lethal if Death Baron leaves the battlefield during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Death Baron doesn\'t normally affect itself. If you manage to turn it into a Skeleton, however, then it will give itself +1/+1 and deathtouch."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Hissing Iguanar dies at the same time as another creature, Hissing Iguanar’s ability triggers.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because devour applies as Skullmulcher enters the battlefield, it can\'t devour creatures that enter the battlefield at the same time as it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Casting Salvage Titan by paying its alternative cost doesn\'t change when you can cast it. You can cast it only at the normal time you could cast a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as Salvage Titan\'s alternative cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You may activate its second ability only if Salvage Titan is in your graveyard. To pay this ability\'s cost, you may exile any three artifact cards from your graveyard—including Salvage Titan itself. If you exile it to pay the cost, however, it won\'t be returned to your hand when the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Each time you put the revealed card into your hand and lose the appropriate amount of life, you decide whether to continue by revealing another card. You don\'t decide in advance how many cards to put into your hand this way."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You may continue to reveal cards with Ad Nauseam even if your life total has been reduced to 0 or less. If you continue, you will continue to lose life, dropping your life total into negative numbers. As soon as you stop, you\'ll lose the game as a state-based action."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'As long as Master of Etherium is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Master of Etherium may become lethal if other artifacts you control leave the battlefield during that turn, and damage dealt to other artifact creatures you control may become lethal if Master of Etherium leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Master of Etherium\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Each turn, each player can cast any number of artifact spells plus a maximum of one nonartifact spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Ethersworn Canonist takes into account spells that were cast earlier in the turn before Ethersworn Canonist entered the battlefield, including any spells that are somehow still on the stack. However, any spells on the stack as Ethersworn Canonist enters the battlefield have already been cast by that point, so they\'re not affected by it."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If Sharuum the Hegemon is put into your graveyard as a state-based action immediately after Sharuum the Hegemon enters the battlefield (most likely due to the “legend rule”) it can be the artifact card targeted by its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "As Fleshbag Marauder\'s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature to sacrifice, then each other player in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all those creatures are sacrificed simultaneously."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "When its ability resolves, you may sacrifice Fleshbag Marauder itself. If you control no other creatures, you\'ll have to sacrifice Fleshbag Marauder."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If either target is an illegal target as Soul\'s Fire resolves, no damage is dealt."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Tidehollow Sculler leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability triggers. This ability does nothing when it resolves. Then its first ability resolves and exiles the chosen card indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'Once you begin to cast Bone Splinters, no player may take actions until you’re done. Notably, opponents can’t try to remove the creature you wish to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can’t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can’t sacrifice additional creatures.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Aasbande\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Aasbande aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine andere Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Viashino, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Viashino jagen in Gruppen, die sich Banden nennen. Nicht alle Banden jagen frische Beute.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9767c2-dfe0-4af9-bcbb-6acf95d90955\', \'multiverseId\': 187629}, \'multiverseid\': 187629}, {\'name\': \'Azotada carroñera\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Azotada carroñera vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, regresa otra carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero viashino\', \'flavor\': \'Los viashino cazan en grupos llamados azotadas. No todas las azotadas buscan las presas más frescas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ecf3275-5c20-4141-a5b3-b72f3d2da91e\', \'multiverseId\': 187878}, \'multiverseid\': 187878}, {\'name\': \'Rosse charognard\', \'text\': \'Quand le Rosse charognard est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez dans votre main une autre carte de créature ciblée de votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : viashino et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Les viashinos chassent en bandes appelées rosses. Toutes ne chassent pas le gibier frais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188625&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4326e7-fdd7-4c78-b6fd-2e6a7f886f59\', \'multiverseId\': 188625}, \'multiverseid\': 188625}, {\'name\': \'Batosta Carogna\', \'text\': "Quando la Batosta Carogna viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano un\'altra carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Viashino\', \'flavor\': \'I viashino cacciano in gruppi chiamati batoste. Non tutte le batoste cacciano la selvaggina più fresca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee76cd6e-cb90-4b2a-b702-f34c109d7942\', \'multiverseId\': 188376}, \'multiverseid\': 188376}, {\'name\': \'腐肉団\', \'text\': \'腐肉団が場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、あなたの墓地にある他のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。 そうした場合、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィーアシーノ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'徒党を組んで狩りをするヴィーアシーノを襲撃団と呼ぶ。 中には新鮮でない獲物を狩るものもいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e55e4619-31fe-463d-9472-730ef0756c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 187131}, \'multiverseid\': 187131}, {\'name\': \'Surrador Carniçal\', \'text\': \'Quando Surrador Carniçal é colocado em um cemitério vindo do jogo, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, devolva outro card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Viashino Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os viashinos caçam em gangues chamadas surradores. Nem todos os surradores estão atrás de caça fresca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad7f3431-6a59-486b-8102-9a9556677531\', \'multiverseId\': 188127}, \'multiverseid\': 188127}, {\'name\': \'Стая Падальщиков\', \'text\': \'Когда Стая Падальщиков попадает из игры на кладбище, вы можете заплатить {2}. Если вы это делаете, верните другую целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Виашино Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Охотничьи отряды виашино называются стаями. Не все стаи охотятся за свежей добычей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'559bec09-0b6c-4143-a387-fdf5b2622125\', \'multiverseId\': 188874}, \'multiverseid\': 188874}, {\'name\': \'腐肉击族\', \'text\': \'当腐肉击族从场上置入坟墓场时，你可以支付{2}。 若你如此作，则将另一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～凡尔西诺／战士\', \'flavor\': \'凡尔西诺狩猎时以称为击族的单位行动。 但并非所有击族都猎捕新鲜的猎物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36e84f1-3b7a-4324-95af-f4d2b8c8254a\', \'multiverseId\': 187380}, \'multiverseid\': 187380}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aasfressender Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aasfressenden Sceada legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'Drachen halten Sceadas für eine Verhöhnung ihrer eigenen Perfektion und vernichten sie, sobald sie welche erblicken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3419bf06-7811-4197-a15c-a5ec8f753b45\', \'multiverseId\': 187552}, \'multiverseid\': 187552}, {\'name\': \'Draco carroñero\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que otra criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Draco carroñero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'Los dragones consideran a los dracos una burla a su perfección, y los destruyen en cuanto los ven.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02fcb2f5-dd21-4c8a-ba26-6e69b6db91f2\', \'multiverseId\': 187801}, \'multiverseid\': 187801}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn nécrophage\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Drakôn nécrophage.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': \'Les considérant comme une insulte à leur perfection, les dragons détruisent les drakôns à vue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343cd71c-765a-4883-abdf-aabb73b7ed3a\', \'multiverseId\': 188548}, \'multiverseid\': 188548}, {\'name\': \'Draghetto Saprofago\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sul Draghetto Saprofago.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'I draghi considerano i draghetti una presa in giro della loro perfezione, quindi li distruggono a vista.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e65acb-9fe4-4b37-92c8-2f591b535f14\', \'multiverseId\': 188299}, \'multiverseid\': 188299}, {\'name\': \'ゴミあさりのドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n他のクリーチャーが１体場からいずれかの墓地に置かれるたび、あなたはゴミあさりのドレイクの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンはドレイクを完璧な自身に対する紛い物とみなし、目に付くたびに滅ぼしていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07929de3-299f-485c-a402-45efd63b9e6a\', \'multiverseId\': 187054}, \'multiverseid\': 187054}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete Rapace\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que outra criatura é colocada no cemitério vinda do jogo, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 sobre Dragonete Rapace.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'Os dragões vêem os dragonetes como um escárnio à sua perfeição, destruindo-os imediatamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a220e12-550a-442a-a304-dd683e7618fc\', \'multiverseId\': 188050}, \'multiverseid\': 188050}, {\'name\': \'Дрейк-Падальщик\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо попадает из игры на кладбище, вы можете положить один жетон +1/+1 на Дрейка-Падальщика.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': \'Драконы считают дрейков насмешкой над собственным совершенством и уничтожают их без всякого промедления.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6209a714-2200-4ad5-8ca2-e920457ba636\', \'multiverseId\': 188797}, \'multiverseid\': 188797}, {\'name\': \'腐食龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当另一个生物从场上置入坟墓场时，你可以在腐食龙兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'巨龙见到龙兽就杀，觉得这是对完美自身的拙劣模仿。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b10dfc9d-a9b1-458c-9a76-be9951fb8699\', \'multiverseId\': 187303}, \'multiverseid\': 187303}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Was du versuchst, ist nicht gegen das Gesetz. Allerdings ist es äußerst dumm."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5393a9-f4f1-48b3-a45f-e7fa1cce98c3\', \'multiverseId\': 187500}, \'multiverseid\': 187500}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que intentas hacer no está contra la ley. Sin embargo, es muy tonto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'793a965f-52b6-4f36-97d7-80039362bec4\', \'multiverseId\': 187749}, \'multiverseid\': 187749}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce que vous tentez n\'est pas interdit par la loi. Cependant, c\'est extrêmement stupide. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188496&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ecd619-4be7-41d8-9b94-95ff7d64fc67\', \'multiverseId\': 188496}, \'multiverseid\': 188496}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quello che stai tentando non è contro la legge. Però, è decisamente sciocco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75cce3c0-de68-40ec-a696-f761f7bfef56\', \'multiverseId\': 188247}, \'multiverseid\': 188247}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前のやりたいことが理屈に逆らってるってことじゃない。 ただ、ものすごく馬鹿げてるってだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62eaf23e-dffb-404c-be90-ab7e627501c6\', \'multiverseId\': 187002}, \'multiverseid\': 187002}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O que você está tentando fazer não é contra a lei. Embora seja extremamente tolo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f8f6f6-48e9-4f55-a648-032b168dd6ba\', \'multiverseId\': 187998}, \'multiverseid\': 187998}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«То, что вы пытаетесь сделать, не противозаконно. Хотя крайне глупо».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f68b0108-a155-43c5-a64a-167c45e58055\', \'multiverseId\': 188745}, \'multiverseid\': 188745}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你想作的并不犯法。 不过，实在是极端愚蠢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d530142d-2855-4c0f-b854-c8db05284d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 187251}, \'multiverseid\': 187251}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abweichen\', \'text\': \'Verändere das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs deiner Wahl, der nur ein einzelnes Ziel hat.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Todesbeschwörer sind uns von der Anzahl und der reinen Macht überlegen. Wir müssen sie mit Scharfsinn in den richtigen Augenblicken erwischen." —Rannon, Vithianischer Ausharrer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187667&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4be39931-35d8-4748-90bb-5fad7bd3595e\', \'multiverseId\': 187667}, \'multiverseid\': 187667}, {\'name\': \'Virar\', \'text\': \'Cambia el objetivo del hechizo objetivo que tenga un solo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No podemos vencer a los necromantes en cantidad o poder. Debemos vencerlos con ingenuidad y oportunidad." —Rannon, centinela vithiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c71468-3375-4d06-ba42-8f7ec9ca7802\', \'multiverseId\': 187916}, \'multiverseid\': 187916}, {\'name\': \'Embardée\', \'text\': \'Remplacez la cible du sort ciblé qui a une cible unique.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nous ne vaincrons pas les nécromanciens par le nombre ou par la force brute. Nous devons les vaincre grâce à l\'ingéniosité et la stratégie. » —Rannon, objecteur vithien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188663&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4b2ab1e-6848-4d6c-aaad-9a65dcdf20b4\', \'multiverseId\': 188663}, \'multiverseid\': 188663}, {\'name\': \'Spostare\', \'text\': \'Cambia il bersaglio di una magia bersaglio che ha un singolo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non possiamo sconfiggere i necromanti per numero o pura forza. Dobbiamo sconfiggerli con ingegnosità e tempismo." —Rannon, renitente di Vithia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7178659f-2b12-4e24-b561-3fd714923a79\', \'multiverseId\': 188414}, \'multiverseid\': 188414}, {\'name\': \'急転回\', \'text\': \'単一の対象を持つ呪文１つを対象とし、それの対象を変更する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「数や素の力では屍術士には勝てないだろう。 機を見計らって、搦め手で倒さねば。」 ――ヴィティアの交渉人、ラノン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c22ea6-a8c6-4e5e-b95c-6648ab808613\', \'multiverseId\': 187169}, \'multiverseid\': 187169}, {\'name\': \'Divergir\', \'text\': \'Mude o alvo da mágica alvo que tenha um único alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os necromantes nos superam em número e força bruta. Precisamos derrotá-los com engenhosidade e paciência." — Rannon, embargador vithiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435d6d86-e511-449b-a183-624d2a641edf\', \'multiverseId\': 188165}, \'multiverseid\': 188165}, {\'name\': \'Отклонение\', \'text\': \'Измените цель целевого заклинания с единственной целью.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Нам не победить некромантов ни числом, ни грубой силой. Мы должны одержать победу за счет изобретательности и правильно выбранного момента». — Раннон, витийский отказник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad2958a-2649-438d-befc-8bbcccb4bff0\', \'multiverseId\': 188912}, \'multiverseid\': 188912}, {\'name\': \'方向偏离\', \'text\': \'为仅指定单一目标的目标咒语更改目标。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们无法以数量或蛮力来打败死灵术士。 必得依赖智谋与时机。」 ～威西亚拒斥人拉农\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eaeeb67-5142-4f73-8ae7-60d524e653a0\', \'multiverseId\': 187418}, \'multiverseid\': 187418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani der Rächer\', \'text\': \'+1: Eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl enttappt während des nächsten Enttapp-Segments ihres Beherrschers nicht.\\n-2: Ajani der Rächer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu, und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n-7: Zerstöre alle Länder, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43abbcca-7eaa-4fe1-ac45-dcdfce6459da\', \'multiverseId\': 187621}, \'multiverseid\': 187621}, {\'name\': \'Ajani Vengativo\', \'text\': \'+1: El permanente objetivo no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\\n-2: Ajani Vengativo hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo y tú ganas 3 vidas.\\n-7: Destruye todas las tierras que controla el jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'849d5706-9254-4285-b9f3-2c172ddbe89b\', \'multiverseId\': 187870}, \'multiverseid\': 187870}, {\'name\': \'Ajani le Vengeur\', \'text\': \'+1 : Le permanent ciblé ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\\n-2 : Ajani le Vengeur inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\n-7 : Détruisez tous les terrains que le joueur ciblé contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5439f5-cec7-4b5f-b709-d12527ca5b50\', \'multiverseId\': 188617}, \'multiverseid\': 188617}, {\'name\': \'Ajani Vendicativo\', \'text\': "+1: Un permanente bersaglio non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\\n-2: L\'Ajani Vendicativo infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.\\n-7: Distruggi tutte le terre controllate da un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b592ecfd-e668-4600-9c74-8290d67c61d3\', \'multiverseId\': 188368}, \'multiverseid\': 188368}, {\'name\': \'復讐のアジャニ\', \'text\': \'+1:パーマネント１つを対象とする。それはそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n-2:クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。復讐のアジャニはそれに３点のダメージを与え、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\n-7:プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするすべての土地を破壊する。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21c4a3bd-1a7a-4085-a94e-4717a61049bd\', \'multiverseId\': 187123}, \'multiverseid\': 187123}, {\'name\': \'Vingador Ajani\', \'text\': \'+1: A permanente alvo não é desvirada durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\\n-2: Vingador Ajani causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\n-7: Destrua todos os terrenos que o jogador alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83122bd0-5ab5-4d0a-9dae-0fd345bd9c51\', \'multiverseId\': 188119}, \'multiverseid\': 188119}, {\'name\': \'Мстящий Аджани\', \'text\': \'+1: целевой перманент не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\\n-2: Мстящий Аджани наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку, а вы получаете 3 жизни.\\n-7: уничтожьте все земли под контролем целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8d0f242-4df6-4f35-9c83-4fd0fd884b7c\', \'multiverseId\': 188866}, \'multiverseid\': 188866}, {\'name\': \'复仇阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：目标永久物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\\n-2：复仇阿耶尼对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害，且你获得3点生命。\\n-7：消灭由目标牌手操控的所有地。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee4579a6-f1dd-4ff0-ac23-cb0e06998ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 187372}, \'multiverseid\': 187372}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akrasischer Junker\', \'text\': \'Edelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Die Armeen Bants bestehen hauptsächlich aus Angehörigen der Mörtel-Kaste: treuen Gefolgsleuten, die sich noch kein Siegel verdient haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecfd6254-9d47-4fe0-a61b-79e77a87df2f\', \'multiverseId\': 187468}, \'multiverseid\': 187468}, {\'name\': \'Escudero akrasano\', \'text\': \'Exaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controles ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los ejércitos de Bant están principalmente compuestos de miembros de la casta inferior, plebeyos leales que todavía no ganaron un sello.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a64bd429-0040-4a7c-83a3-6c18d1927a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 187717}, \'multiverseid\': 187717}, {\'name\': \'Écuyer akrasan\', \'text\': "Exaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les armées de Bant sont principalement composées de membres de la caste Mortar, des roturiers loyaux qui n\'ont pas encore reçu de sigille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e131b0c8-9c41-428c-979b-19d9733c9521\', \'multiverseId\': 188464}, \'multiverseid\': 188464}, {\'name\': \'Scudiero di Akrasa\', \'text\': \'Esaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli eserciti di Bant sono composti principalmente dai membri della casta Mortaio, leali cittadini che non hanno ancora guadagnato un sigillo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec1bf5f-856d-4d52-9064-1183eadda9bc\', \'multiverseId\': 188215}, \'multiverseid\': 188215}, {\'name\': \'アクラサの従者\', \'text\': \'賛美 （あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'バントの軍隊は、印章をまだ受けていない臣民からなる石膏階級の人々が主だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=186970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c73a2ba6-b841-48ac-a7ce-080ef2900f94\', \'multiverseId\': 186970}, \'multiverseid\': 186970}, {\'name\': \'Escudeiro Akrasano\', \'text\': \'Exaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os exércitos de Bant são compostos principalmente por membros do Castelo de Mortar, devotados plebeus que ainda não receberam uma insígnia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab625e4f-7169-4dee-9c06-7e2b03eeb3d2\', \'multiverseId\': 187966}, \'multiverseid\': 187966}, {\'name\': \'Акрасский Оруженосец\', \'text\': \'Повышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Армии Бэнта состоят в основном из представителей касты Мортаров верных простолюдинов, еще не заслуживших ни одной медали.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33601a51-1275-4cb2-8b12-7688138eee10\', \'multiverseId\': 188713}, \'multiverseid\': 188713}, {\'name\': \'阿卡沙扈从\', \'text\': \'颂威 （每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'班特的军队主要以莫达种姓的人组成，是群忠贞而尚未获得印记的凡夫俗子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8418835-912a-4db8-8b8b-1b455303f530\', \'multiverseId\': 187219}, \'multiverseid\': 187219}]', '[{\'name\': \'Algen-Gavial\', \'text\': \'Verhüllt\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Algen-Gavial legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krokodil\', \'flavor\': \'Er lauert direkt unter der Wasseroberfläche der algendurchsetzten Teergruben, die für ihn Heimat und Jagdtarnung sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b966495-2986-462d-b900-dc87a7cdf4da\', \'multiverseId\': 187590}, \'multiverseid\': 187590}, {\'name\': \'Gavial de algas\', \'text\': \'Velo.\\nSiempre que otra criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Gavial de algas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cocodrilo\', \'flavor\': \'Acecha bajo la superficie de los pozos de alquitrán llenos de algas de Jund, usándolos de hogar y territorio de caza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35663cc4-5a54-4ba4-8b70-0e867135cfbf\', \'multiverseId\': 187839}, \'multiverseid\': 187839}, {\'name\': \'Gavial des algues\', \'text\': "Linceul\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Gavial des algues.", \'type\': \'Créature : crocodile\', \'flavor\': "Il rôde au-dessous de la surface, se servant des fosses à goudron recouvertes d\'algues de Jund comme habitat et abri de chasse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2acbc5e4-9272-4a2c-b5de-196cf58bface\', \'multiverseId\': 188586}, \'multiverseid\': 188586}, {\'name\': \'Gaviale delle Alghe\', \'text\': "Velo\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sul Gaviale delle Alghe.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Coccodrillo\', \'flavor\': "E\' in agguato appena sotto la superficie, sfruttando le pozze di catrame di Jund intasate dalle alghe sia come casa che come nascondiglio da caccia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c31b85-6394-479c-a5f7-6ad68fc3b10a\', \'multiverseId\': 188337}, \'multiverseid\': 188337}, {\'name\': \'藻のガリアル\', \'text\': \'被覆\\n他のクリーチャーが１体場からいずれかの墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは藻のガリアルの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クロコダイル\', \'flavor\': \'それは水面のすぐ下に潜み、ジャンドの藻の詰まったタール孔を住処とし、また狩りの隠れ蓑としている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c4771fb-77aa-4db3-8381-fda22885183c\', \'multiverseId\': 187092}, \'multiverseid\': 187092}, {\'name\': \'Gavial das Algas\', \'text\': \'Manto\\nToda vez que outra criatura é colocada no cemitério vinda do jogo, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em Gavial das Algas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Crocodilo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele se esconde logo abaixo da superfície, e usa os poços de piche cobertos de algas de Jund como seu lar e esconderijo de caça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49942e75-d580-421e-9ac6-8e5be6f9603c\', \'multiverseId\': 188088}, \'multiverseid\': 188088}, {\'name\': \'Водорослевый Гавиал\', \'text\': \'Пелена\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо попадает из игры на кладбище, вы можете положить один жетон +1/+1 на Водорослевого Гавиала.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Крокодил\', \'flavor\': \'Он прячется у самой поверхности в заросших водорослями смоляных ямах Джанда, которые служат ему и домом, и местом охоты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7587966-7801-41ca-a184-18290c0ea8dc\', \'multiverseId\': 188835}, \'multiverseid\': 188835}, {\'name\': \'野藻长吻鳄\', \'text\': \'帷幕\\n每当另一个生物从场上置入坟墓场时，你可以在野藻长吻鳄上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳄鱼\', \'flavor\': \'他就躲在水面下，用遍布野藻的勇得焦油坑当作家园与埋伏藏身所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3781c0-3911-4526-bd02-dbc8914fa7cb\', \'multiverseId\': 187341}, \'multiverseid\': 187341}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altmaterial-Titan\', \'text\': \'Du kannst drei Artefakte opfern, anstatt die Manakosten des Altmaterial-Titanen zu bezahlen.\\nEntferne drei Artefaktkarten aus deinem Friedhof ganz aus dem Spiel: Bringe den Altmaterial-Titan aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b86b77-e3d9-419b-b9dc-11bb9394f0a9\', \'multiverseId\': 187551}, \'multiverseid\': 187551}, {\'name\': \'Titán del botín\', \'text\': \'Puedes sacrificar tres artefactos en lugar de pagar el coste de maná del Titán del botín.\\nRemover del juego tres cartas de artefacto de tu cementerio: Regresa el Titán del botín de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b888c6e-fc4d-460d-9041-4d744cee96f2\', \'multiverseId\': 187800}, \'multiverseid\': 187800}, {\'name\': \'Titan de récupération\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez sacrifier trois artefacts à la place de payer le coût de mana du Titan de récupération.\\nRetirez de la partie trois cartes d\'artefact de votre cimetière : Renvoyez le Titan de récupération depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ec169a-0490-42e3-9c7e-3321f7aba10e\', \'multiverseId\': 188547}, \'multiverseid\': 188547}, {\'name\': \'Titano di Recupero\', \'text\': \'Puoi sacrificare tre artefatti invece di pagare il costo di mana del Titano di Recupero.\\nRimuovi dal gioco tre carte artefatto nel tuo cimitero: Riprendi in mano il Titano di Recupero dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'714b2d92-4045-46c4-9f3c-eb978766611c\', \'multiverseId\': 188298}, \'multiverseid\': 188298}, {\'name\': \'回収するタイタン\', \'text\': \'あなたは回収するタイタンのマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、アーティファクトを３つ生け贄に捧げてもよい。\\nあなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カードを３枚ゲームから取り除く：回収するタイタンをあなたの墓地からあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f1a9833-b716-4461-8f6c-0bb1e93005cf\', \'multiverseId\': 187053}, \'multiverseid\': 187053}, {\'name\': \'Titã de Resgate\', \'text\': \'Você pode sacrificar três artefatos em vez de pagar o custo de mana de Titã de Resgate.\\nRemova do jogo três cards de artefato no seu cemitério: Devolva Titã de Resgate de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b7d170-ff65-41c8-a7b5-04aabb902fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 188049}, \'multiverseid\': 188049}, {\'name\': \'Утильный Титан\', \'text\': \'Вы можете пожертвовать три артефакта, а не платить мана-стоимость Утильного Титана.\\nУдалите из игры три карты артефактов, находящихся на вашем кладбище: верните Утильного Титана из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9c949f9-e03a-4be6-8bba-a9ffd57bdd36\', \'multiverseId\': 188796}, \'multiverseid\': 188796}, {\'name\': \'废品泰坦\', \'text\': \'你可以牺牲三个神器，而不支付废品泰坦的法术力费用。\\n从你坟墓场中将三张神器牌移出对战：将废品泰坦从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d821bcb-d45e-4695-845c-13ff2a7a9074\', \'multiverseId\': 187302}, \'multiverseid\': 187302}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Bant\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl; oder lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers; oder neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bant ist eine Welt, in der Tod und Chaos keinerlei Macht haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187622&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe6f4389-95a5-4d9f-8404-1e292c081a84\', \'multiverseId\': 187622}, \'multiverseid\': 187622}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto bantiano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Destruye el artefacto objetivo; o pon la criatura objetivo en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario; o contrarresta el hechizo instantáneo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Bant es un mundo donde la muerte y el caos no tienen lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e2df9d-e356-40a7-bf2f-169bd50b7a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 187871}, \'multiverseid\': 187871}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Bant\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un — Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ; ou mettez la créature ciblée au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire ; ou contrecarrez le sort d\'éphémère ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Bant est un monde où la mort et le chaos n\'ont pas prise.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188618&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'595f6f2c-3dbe-4912-bce7-5b17c6eb8645\', \'multiverseId\': 188618}, \'multiverseid\': 188618}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Bant\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio; oppure metti una creatura bersaglio in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario; oppure neutralizza una magia istantaneo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Bant è un mondo in cui morte e caos non hanno alcun potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e773851-656d-427a-b9f7-3b548108a80f\', \'multiverseId\': 188369}, \'multiverseid\': 188369}, {\'name\': \'バントの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下の３つから１つを選ぶ。「アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。」「クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。」「インスタント呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。」\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'バントは死と混沌が揺らがない世界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b50b1c-4b17-40ce-a09c-53b77adb91fd\', \'multiverseId\': 187124}, \'multiverseid\': 187124}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Bant\', \'text\': \'Escolha um Destrua o artefato alvo; ou coloque a criatura alvo no fundo do grimório de seu dono; ou anule a mágica instantânea alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Bant é um mundo onde a morte e o caos não têm vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f3b144-6d51-46d4-9f97-790d841a6b1e\', \'multiverseId\': 188120}, \'multiverseid\': 188120}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Бэнта\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно уничтожьте целевой артефакт; или положите целевое существо в низ библиотеки его владельца; или отмените целевое мгновенное заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Бэнт это мир, над которым не властны смерть и хаос.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a792eb94-7021-4553-b8ab-f22fede25dd5\', \'multiverseId\': 188867}, \'multiverseid\': 188867}, {\'name\': \'班特护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～消灭目标神器；或将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库底；或反击目标瞬间咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'班特这世界几乎和死亡与混沌无缘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37c1b2d1-4a09-4300-9fca-d1e666ec0490\', \'multiverseId\': 187373}, \'multiverseid\': 187373}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Esper\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl; oder ziehe zwei Karten; oder ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gedanken sind Güter. Irgendjemand wird einen guten Preis dafür bezahlen, selbst wenn sie so simpel sind wie deine." —Ennor, Mentalist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f818cfac-b3a1-4404-8053-8f1db4ffb8a7\', \'multiverseId\': 187634}, \'multiverseid\': 187634}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto esperiano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Destruye el encantamiento objetivo; o roba dos cartas; o el jugador objetivo descarta dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los pensamientos son un lujo. Algunos pagan un buen precio por ellos. Incluso por unos simples como los tuyos..." —Ennor, mentalista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b73e5f-f99e-404a-a7b0-5192d4690ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 187883}, \'multiverseid\': 187883}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'Esper", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un — Détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé ; ou piochez deux cartes ; ou le joueur ciblé se défausse de deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les pensées sont des articles de luxe. Il se trouvera toujours quelqu\'un pour les acheter à bon prix. Même si elles sont aussi simplistes que les vôtres . . . » —Ennor, mentaliste", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188630&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8cc10fa-11b6-412d-a595-5eb3d1a3bfce\', \'multiverseId\': 188630}, \'multiverseid\': 188630}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Esper\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio; oppure pesca due carte; oppure un giocatore bersaglio scarta due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I pensieri sono un bene prezioso. Alcuni pagherebbero un buon prezzo per averne. Perfino quelli semplicistici come i tuoi. . ." —Ennor, mentalista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dcab24f-1adf-4cd8-b814-60d50a77d392\', \'multiverseId\': 188381}, \'multiverseid\': 188381}, {\'name\': \'エスパーの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下の３つから１つを選ぶ。「エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。」「カードを２枚引く。」「プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚捨てる。」\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「思考は消耗品だ。 高値でそれを買うやつもいる。 お前のような単純極まりないものであってもな……」 ――精神士イーノー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ee23271-304f-4939-941e-80562d53cf4b\', \'multiverseId\': 187136}, \'multiverseid\': 187136}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Esper\', \'text\': \'Escolha um Destrua o encantamento alvo; ou compre dois cards; ou o jogador alvo descarta dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os pensamentos são mercadorias. Alguém pagará um bom preço por eles. Mesmo por pensamentos banais como os seus. . ." — Ennor, mentalista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be28fd24-1dcb-473a-8a3b-f6f083ae23de\', \'multiverseId\': 188132}, \'multiverseid\': 188132}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Эспера\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно уничтожьте целевые чары; или возьмите две карты; или целевой игрок сбрасывает две карты.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мысли это товар. Кто-нибудь заплатит за них хорошую цену. Даже за такие примитивные, как ваши...» — Иннор, маг-менталист\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac872fd-5611-4b35-9fab-00bf6f7fef43\', \'multiverseId\': 188879}, \'multiverseid\': 188879}, {\'name\': \'艾斯波护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～消灭目标结界；或抓两张牌；或目标牌手弃两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「想法是好东西。 有人愿意出好价钱来买； 即使是像你所想的这么单纯...」 ～心灵法师依诺\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d0a1652-7359-46f0-abb4-096596f05018\', \'multiverseId\': 187385}, \'multiverseid\': 187385}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Grixis\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück; oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-4 bis zum Ende des Zuges; oder Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Was für eine Auswahl. Will ich heute Abscheu, Hass oder Niedertracht?" —Eliza aus der Festung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187638&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2295654e-b1c0-4163-ab25-df8fe204f0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 187638}, \'multiverseid\': 187638}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto grixiano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario; o la criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-4 hasta el final del turno; o las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tantas opciones. ¿Qué es lo mejor para hoy? ¿Odio, malicia o desprecio?" —Eliza de la Fortaleza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ddb55de-634e-4539-8eda-61efce193025\', \'multiverseId\': 187887}, \'multiverseid\': 187887}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Grixis\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un — Renvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire ; ou la créature ciblée gagne -4/-4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour ; ou les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Tant de choix. Vais-je opter aujourd\'hui pour le dégoût, la haine ou la malice ? » —Eliza de la Forteresse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188634&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c4a56a-1977-4180-a9ed-6d1f999c2d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 188634}, \'multiverseid\': 188634}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Grixis\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno Fai tornare un permanente bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario; oppure una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-4 fino alla fine del turno; oppure le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Così tante scelte. Dovrei scegliere ribrezzo, odio o malignità oggi?" —Eliza della Fortezza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce249767-300f-4345-ae2c-f3017265d65d\', \'multiverseId\': 188385}, \'multiverseid\': 188385}, {\'name\': \'グリクシスの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下の３つから１つを選ぶ。「パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。」「クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－４/－４の修整を受ける。」「あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。」\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「迷うねえ。 嫌悪と憎悪と険悪と、今日はどれがいい？」 ――砦のエリーザ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e537faf-b7c3-4d7e-8e2d-a70615a6f28e\', \'multiverseId\': 187140}, \'multiverseid\': 187140}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Grixis\', \'text\': \'Escolha um Devolva a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono; ou a criatura alvo recebe -4/-4 até o final do turno; ou as criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"São tantas as escolhas. Devo escolher aversão, ódio ou maldade hoje?" — Eliza da Fortaleza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e05b48d5-a8a6-4128-86da-31b80b87b953\', \'multiverseId\': 188136}, \'multiverseid\': 188136}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Гриксиса\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно верните целевой перманент в руку его владельца; или целевое существо получает -4/-4 до конца хода; или существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Какое разнообразие Что же мне сегодня выбрать отвращение, ненависть или злобу?» — Элиза из Замковой Башни\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2120e9c-8ed9-484a-a8b9-1f9c480bb567\', \'multiverseId\': 188883}, \'multiverseid\': 188883}, {\'name\': \'格利极护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～将目标永久物移回其拥有者手上；或目标生物得-4/-4直到回合结束；或由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「选择真多。 今天该选嫌恶，仇恨，还是毒辣？」 ～要塞的伊莉莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51bba91e-2c5b-45e6-8a9e-79afba515a94\', \'multiverseId\': 187389}, \'multiverseid\': 187389}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Jund\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines Entferne den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ganz aus dem Spiel; oder das Amulett aus Jund fügt jeder Kreatur 2 Schadenspunkte zu; oder lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Jund pulsiert vor roher Energie, die nur darauf wartet, von Schamanen in nützliche Form gebracht zu werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187642&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8946fc7f-7553-4f0e-9ae6-624d39470bad\', \'multiverseId\': 187642}, \'multiverseid\': 187642}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto jundiano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Remueve del juego el cementerio del jugador objetivo; o el Amuleto jundiano le hace 2 puntos de daño a cada criatura; o pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Jund late con energía vital, esperando que los chamanes le den una forma útil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52cce263-47f1-428f-b1b6-e2a7d3d4f53f\', \'multiverseId\': 187891}, \'multiverseid\': 187891}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Jund\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un — Retirez de la partie le cimetière du joueur ciblé ; ou le Charme de Jund inflige 2 blessures à chaque créature ; ou mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Jund vibre d\'énergie brute qui attend que les shamanes lui donnent une forme utilisable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188638&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e3ae11-4db5-4e9b-9546-bf3c1458c180\', \'multiverseId\': 188638}, \'multiverseid\': 188638}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Jund\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno Rimuovi dal gioco il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio; oppure il Monile di Jund infligge 2 danni a ogni creatura; oppure metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Jund pulsa di energia grezza, in attesa che gli sciamani la modellino in una forma utile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b97ddd2-a9ed-459b-a327-d26c1e8d9d03\', \'multiverseId\': 188389}, \'multiverseid\': 188389}, {\'name\': \'ジャンドの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下の３つから１つを選ぶ。「プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーの墓地をゲームから取り除く。」「ジャンドの魔除けは各クリーチャーに、それぞれ２点のダメージを与える。」「クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。」\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ジャンドの素の魔力の波動は、シャーマンに有効な形に作られることを待ち望んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12cd1601-7f60-456b-912c-73c05e639e6c\', \'multiverseId\': 187144}, \'multiverseid\': 187144}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Jund\', \'text\': \'Escolha um Remova do jogo o cemitério do jogador alvo; ou Medalhão de Jund causa 2 pontos de dano a cada criatura; ou coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Jund pulsa com energia crua, aguardando que os xamãs a moldem em formas úteis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'932be69d-672d-4464-94d1-e8b48270bf72\', \'multiverseId\': 188140}, \'multiverseid\': 188140}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Джанда\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно удалите кладбище целевого игрока из игры; или Талисман Джанда наносит 2 повреждения каждому существу; или положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Джанд пульсирует сырой энергией в ожидании, что шаманы облекут ее в полезную форму.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b462d960-d03f-4799-a5e2-f878be1468e5\', \'multiverseId\': 188887}, \'multiverseid\': 188887}, {\'name\': \'勇得护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～将目标牌手的坟墓场移出对战；或勇得护符对每个生物各造成2点伤害；或在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'勇得的脉动充满原始能量，等着祭师来将它塑造成有用的型式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f09b39de-f9e1-4a38-8f87-bebe593f17fb\', \'multiverseId\': 187393}, \'multiverseid\': 187393}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Naya\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines Das Amulett aus Naya fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu; oder bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück; oder tappe alle Kreaturen, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Tief im Herzen der Natur liegen noch Kräfte, die weder von der Gier noch von der Zivilisation beschmutzt wurden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187647&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd47143-4194-4d01-937e-2a0a4c9cfcec\', \'multiverseId\': 187647}, \'multiverseid\': 187647}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto nayano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: El Amuleto nayano hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo; o regresa la carta objetivo en un cementerio a la mano de su propietario; o gira todas las criaturas que controla el jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En lo profundo de la naturaleza hay un potencial no manchado por la civilización o la avaricia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d2987ad-7e4d-4bd3-828c-8dc81f93b9c2\', \'multiverseId\': 187896}, \'multiverseid\': 187896}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Naya\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un — Le Charme de Naya inflige 3 blessures à la créature ciblée ; ou renvoyez la carte ciblée d\'un cimetière dans la main de son propriétaire ; ou engagez toutes les créatures que le joueur ciblé contrôle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Au plus profond de la nature se cache un potentiel qui n\'a pas été souillé par l\'envie ou la civilisation.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188643&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1df8def-2da4-440f-816d-db3ef922b550\', \'multiverseId\': 188643}, \'multiverseid\': 188643}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Naya\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno Il Monile di Naya infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio; oppure fai tornare una carta bersaglio in un cimitero in mano al suo proprietario; oppure TAPpa tutte le creature controllate da un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nel profondo del cuore della natura si trova un potenziale incontaminato da avidità o civiltà.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef44e974-8819-4f30-b9a8-5317490312b6\', \'multiverseId\': 188394}, \'multiverseid\': 188394}, {\'name\': \'ナヤの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下の３つから１つを選ぶ。「クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ナヤの魔除けはそれに３点のダメージを与える。」「いずれかの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。」「プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーをタップする。」\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'自然の核のさらに深く、欲にも文明にも汚されていない力が眠っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b20070ec-cb2b-43b3-8f88-1b9092fd867b\', \'multiverseId\': 187149}, \'multiverseid\': 187149}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Naya\', \'text\': \'Escolha um Medalhão de Naya causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo; ou devolva o card alvo num cemitério para a mão de seu dono; ou vire todas as criaturas que o jogador alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nas profundezas da natureza jaz um potencial ainda imaculado pela ganância ou pela sociedade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e58fb7a-53b2-4bd5-8098-12de8d964b02\', \'multiverseId\': 188145}, \'multiverseid\': 188145}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Найи\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно Талисман Найи наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу; или верните находящуюся на кладбище целевую карту в руку ее владельца; или поверните все существа под контролем целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Глубоко в недрах природы залегает потенциал, не запятнанный жадностью и цивилизацией.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d49240b-80f7-4969-b4a0-d333ce004aed\', \'multiverseId\': 188892}, \'multiverseid\': 188892}, {\'name\': \'纳雅护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～纳雅护符对目标生物造成3点伤害；或将目标牌从坟墓场移回其拥有者手上；或横置所有由目标牌手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'大自然核心中深埋着未受贪婪或文明所污染的潜力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7e1132-929d-4d5e-a3e0-a863e0117d9b\', \'multiverseId\': 187398}, \'multiverseid\': 187398}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anstürmender Rhox\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nEdelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nashorn, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Schwung ist ein guter Verbündeter."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187612&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54c6910-bc09-48e8-811a-b640df65d7a7\', \'multiverseId\': 187612}, \'multiverseid\': 187612}, {\'name\': \'Cargador rhox\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nExaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controles ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'"La inercia es un gran aliado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06475d99-f60b-4b05-ad4d-e3e4f60219aa\', \'multiverseId\': 187861}, \'multiverseid\': 187861}, {\'name\': \'Batailleur rhox\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nExaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : rhinocéros et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« La vitesse a toujours du bon. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188608&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba80c1a-be7f-4343-84ff-793e70332d78\', \'multiverseId\': 188608}, \'multiverseid\': 188608}, {\'name\': \'Rhox alla Carica\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nEsaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo slancio è un grande alleato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38164e2e-58df-4af2-a62a-460b1bad2b06\', \'multiverseId\': 188359}, \'multiverseid\': 188359}, {\'name\': \'ロウクスの突撃者\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n賛美 （あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「勢いは偉大なる味方だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f459aa21-826d-4951-aad0-99c30dab9893\', \'multiverseId\': 187114}, \'multiverseid\': 187114}, {\'name\': \'Atacante Rhox\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nExaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"O impulso é um grande aliado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07687665-43b7-4583-b7bf-1dd3710c0e65\', \'multiverseId\': 188110}, \'multiverseid\': 188110}, {\'name\': \'Нападающий Рокс\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nПовышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Носорог Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Инерция прекрасный союзник».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'466893e8-aac7-4e59-ae6b-05be74beaf4b\', \'multiverseId\': 188857}, \'multiverseid\': 188857}, {\'name\': \'冲锋罗克\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n颂威 （每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～犀牛／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「动量是个好帮手。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51cdff85-cd70-46f9-8908-7bc82ee21efc\', \'multiverseId\': 187363}, \'multiverseid\': 187363}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgezeichneter Paladin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nEdelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'Jedes Siegel zeugt von einer bedeutenden Tat des Trägers und bedeutet eine Pflicht gegenüber dem, der es verliehen hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187494&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af9bf80-5a85-44a7-926a-143163db941f\', \'multiverseId\': 187494}, \'multiverseid\': 187494}, {\'name\': \'Paladín con sellos\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nExaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controles ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Cada sello marca el reconocimiento de una gran acción y simboliza un trabajo hecho para quien la otorgó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d648ba5-af13-4e7a-b1ef-bd79108c84b0\', \'multiverseId\': 187743}, \'multiverseid\': 187743}, {\'name\': \'Paladin sigillé\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nExaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "Chaque sigille marque la reconnaissance d\'un grand exploit et implique un devoir envers celui qui l\'a accordé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188490&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061ee69c-4a7c-4464-a447-268d69ba1795\', \'multiverseId\': 188490}, \'multiverseid\': 188490}, {\'name\': \'Paladino dei Sigilli\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nEsaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': "Ogni sigillo indica il riconoscimento di una grande impresa e denota una deferenza dovuta a colui che l\'ha conferito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9394357a-922b-4e83-8e49-53665a966fbd\', \'multiverseId\': 188241}, \'multiverseid\': 188241}, {\'name\': \'印章持ちの聖騎士\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n賛美 （あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'印章にはそれぞれ偉大なる行いを示す印が刻まれ、それを与えられたものが負うべき務めを示している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=186996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27c4800d-5573-419c-8554-5005c7fe876e\', \'multiverseId\': 186996}, \'multiverseid\': 186996}, {\'name\': \'Paladino Insigne\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nExaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'Cada insígnia marca o reconhecimento por um grande feito e representa um débito com quem a concedeu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f03f82-37d4-43d9-b8f2-200ba0500eba\', \'multiverseId\': 187992}, \'multiverseid\': 187992}, {\'name\': \'Медаленосный Паладин\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nПовышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'Каждая медаль символизирует признание благородного подвига и означает долг героя перед тем, кто его наградил.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c3278cc-6097-4365-8dc6-97cbb61e9eed\', \'multiverseId\': 188739}, \'multiverseid\': 188739}, {\'name\': \'持印神圣武士\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n颂威 （每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'每个印记都代表着受肯定的重大成就，也象征了对授印者应履行的责任。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a6cf37d-aa62-42cf-b173-d14130ebb1ed\', \'multiverseId\': 187245}, \'multiverseid\': 187245}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behinderndes Licht\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, der dich oder eine bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, als Ziel hat.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Jahrhunderte der sorgfältigen Übung haben das Sprechen von Schutzzaubern zu einer Kunstform gemacht. Das wenige, was in Bant an Offensivmagie noch zur Verfügung steht, hat keine Chance, durchzukommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187640&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ab6ea3-516a-490e-9f01-01dcd57030d0\', \'multiverseId\': 187640}, \'multiverseid\': 187640}, {\'name\': \'Luz obstaculizadora\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo que hace objetivo a un permanente que controlas o a ti.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Siglos de práctica cuidadosa han elevado la magia de los hechizos protectores a una forma de arte. La poca magia ofensiva que queda en Bant tiene pocas oportunidades de romperlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed99932-2a39-4986-9ed3-36bdb5a5963e\', \'multiverseId\': 187889}, \'multiverseid\': 187889}, {\'name\': \'Lumière obstruante\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé qui vous cible ou qui cible un permanent que vous contrôlez.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les siècles de pratiques ont élevé le lancement des sorts de protection au niveau d\'art. Le peu de magie offensive restant encore sur Bant a peu de chance de les percer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188636&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea7007f-e4bc-44cc-8278-dd263b70e1f0\', \'multiverseId\': 188636}, \'multiverseid\': 188636}, {\'name\': \'Luce Intralciante\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio che bersaglia te o un permanente che controlli.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Secoli di pratica attenta hanno elevato il lancio di magie protettive al grado di forma d\'arte. Quel poco di magia d\'attacco che rimane in Bant ha ben poche probabilità di aprirsi un varco.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1954db-1b41-4432-b725-f45a15dc26b5\', \'multiverseId\': 188387}, \'multiverseid\': 188387}, {\'name\': \'妨げる光\', \'text\': \'あなたかあなたがコントロールするいずれかのパーマネントを対象とする呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'何世紀もの注意深い行動の結果、防御の魔法は芸術の域に達した。 バントに残された攻撃魔法に、それを突破する術を持つもののなんと少ないことか。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c480c18-bcc4-4016-8fd9-c8e468860d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 187142}, \'multiverseid\': 187142}, {\'name\': \'Luz Obstruidora\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo que tenha você ou uma permanente que você controla como alvo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Séculos de prática cuidadosa levaram a conjuração de mágicas de proteção à perfeição. O que quer que tenha restado de mágica ofensiva em Bant não tem chance de atingi-los.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d42dd3-b5b2-4914-b43d-1bd323be4e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 188138}, \'multiverseid\': 188138}, {\'name\': \'Световая Преграда\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание, нацеленное на вас или на перманент под вашим контролем.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Столетия осторожной практики подняли применение защитных заклинаний до высоты настоящего искусства. Если на Бэнте и сохранилась наступательная магия, то вряд ли у нее есть шанс пробить оборону.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aae1591-4883-4b47-9a51-8e0c4af463e0\', \'multiverseId\': 188885}, \'multiverseid\': 188885}, {\'name\': \'阻碍之光\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语，且该咒语须以你或是由你操控的永久物为目标。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'几百年的仔细练习，使得施放防护咒语已迈入艺术境地。 而班特原本便积弱不振的攻击咒语势力根本没机会穿透过去。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88175890-51a5-420b-9927-ea9699019eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 187391}, \'multiverseid\': 187391}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergkamm-Rannet\', \'text\': \'Umwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur wer die Stärke hat, sein Schicksal zu bestimmen, verdient auch eines." —Kratztafeln der Nacatl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187578&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48e80596-b7e9-491b-8c94-e4c28966a263\', \'multiverseId\': 187578}, \'multiverseid\': 187578}, {\'name\': \'Rannet del risco\', \'text\': \'Ciclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Sólo aquellos con la fuerza para dominar su destino merecen uno." —Arañazos nacatl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a77a84ca-659b-499b-9162-164e87317c9c\', \'multiverseId\': 187827}, \'multiverseid\': 187827}, {\'name\': \'Rannet des contreforts\', \'text\': \'Recyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "« Seuls ceux qui ont la force de saisir leur destin méritent d\'en avoir un. » —Grifformes nacatls", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188574&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'666a181f-b46f-4b25-9a12-b8cd7e25cb29\', \'multiverseId\': 188574}, \'multiverseid\': 188574}, {\'name\': \'Rannet del Crinale\', \'text\': \'Ciclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo quelli che hanno la forza di prendere il destino per le corna meritano di averne uno." —Graffiti nacatl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b4075d-d704-4662-ae8b-9eeab300dc3f\', \'multiverseId\': 188325}, \'multiverseid\': 188325}, {\'name\': \'峠のラネット\', \'text\': \'サイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「運命を従える力を持つ者のみが、それを持つに値する。」 ――ナカティルの爪文字書\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37a90836-ba77-4adc-b91f-a807e73eb2e7\', \'multiverseId\': 187080}, \'multiverseid\': 187080}, {\'name\': \'Rannet do Cume\', \'text\': \'Reciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Somente os que são fortes o bastante para agarrar seu destino merecem um." — Protoglifos nacatl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6c5214-e1b9-4e51-b7c6-b9dc2f2705fa\', \'multiverseId\': 188076}, \'multiverseid\': 188076}, {\'name\': \'Раннет Горного Кряжа\', \'text\': \'Цикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Только тот, кто имеет силу управлять своей судьбой, заслуживает ее». — Накатльские начертания\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7dadee2-50cd-4e61-b274-e422ee10adb6\', \'multiverseId\': 188823}, \'multiverseid\': 188823}, {\'name\': \'山脊拉奈兽\', \'text\': \'循环{2} （{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「只有力量足以掌握自身命运的人，才配拥有命运。」 ～拿卡地口述文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e803fb7-e90f-4980-8fc9-43e238a49fff\', \'multiverseId\': 187329}, \'multiverseid\': 187329}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergsturz-Elementar\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf das Bergsturz-Elementar legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'In Jund ist selbst die Landschaft ein tödlicher Jäger. Vulkane, Teergruben und Bergstürze scheinen sich von den Lebenden zu ernähren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25961f3-9638-4781-939b-280aa0f55316\', \'multiverseId\': 187579}, \'multiverseid\': 187579}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de la avalancha\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que otra criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Elemental de la avalancha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'En Jund hasta el paisaje es un cazador mortal. Volcanes, pozos de alquitrán y avalanchas parecen depredar a los vivos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'188c419e-02aa-4b6c-adc0-8b1f1cc6def5\', \'multiverseId\': 187828}, \'multiverseid\': 187828}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de glissement de roches\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Élémental de glissement de roches.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Sur Jund, même le paysage est un dangereux chasseur. Volcans, mares de goudron et glissements de terrain semblent à l\'affût des vivants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e6e4d8-9866-4a69-8cca-82a2411fcd7b\', \'multiverseId\': 188575}, \'multiverseid\': 188575}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Frana Rocciosa\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Elementale Frana Rocciosa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'In Jund, perfino il paesaggio è un cacciatore mortale. Vulcani, pozze di catrame e frane rocciose sembrano far preda dei viventi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195772b6-7af2-454a-ba84-42d28b495610\', \'multiverseId\': 188326}, \'multiverseid\': 188326}, {\'name\': \'崖崩れの精霊\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n他のクリーチャーが１体場からいずれかの墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは崖崩れの精霊の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'ジャンドでは、土地までもが恐ろしい狩人だ。 火口、タール孔、崖崩れなどは、生あるものを餌食と狙っているようだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec70e6c-c079-44ce-9a5d-d4d7a9047d60\', \'multiverseId\': 187081}, \'multiverseid\': 187081}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Deslize de Pedras\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que outra criatura é colocada no cemitério vinda do jogo, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em Elemental do Deslize de Pedras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Em Jund, até mesmo o meio ambiente é um caçador. Vulcões, poços de piche e deslizamentos de pedras fazem dos seres vivos suas presas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5054d46c-686d-4e9e-aedc-b7a7724d0555\', \'multiverseId\': 188077}, \'multiverseid\': 188077}, {\'name\': \'Элементаль Скального Оползня\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо попадает из игры на кладбище, вы можете положить один жетон +1/+1 на Элементаля Скального Оползня.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Даже природа на Джанде смертоносный хищник. Вулканы, смоляные ямы и оползни словно охотятся на все живое.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b08466-a096-4540-bb60-2f305d1d3657\', \'multiverseId\': 188824}, \'multiverseid\': 188824}, {\'name\': \'崩岩元素\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当另一个生物从场上置入坟墓场时，你可以在崩岩元素上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'在勇得，就连地景都是夺命猎手。 火山，焦油坑，以及山崩似乎都想要捕猎活物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b121295e-f0bc-4714-b242-01db9dd06b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 187330}, \'multiverseid\': 187330}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bis zum Erbrechen\', \'text\': \'Zeige die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer umgewandelten Manakosten. Du kannst diesen Prozess beliebig oft wiederholen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Arbeit in den Bereich des Untoten überging, nannte er sie nicht mehr sein Lebenswerk.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de74fc0-fe71-4ccd-b2e7-8b4e1799a8e1\', \'multiverseId\': 187530}, \'multiverseid\': 187530}, {\'name\': \'Ad nauseam\', \'text\': \'Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca y ponla en tu mano. Pierdes una cantidad de vida igual a su coste de maná convertido. Puedes repetir este proceso tantas veces como quieras.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando su tarea continuó en la muerte viviente, dejó de llamarlo "el trabajo de mi vida".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be15813-0a00-4ff9-874b-289289636a0d\', \'multiverseId\': 187779}, \'multiverseid\': 187779}, {\'name\': \'Ad Nauseam\', \'text\': \'Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et mettez cette carte dans votre main. Vous perdez autant de points de vie que son coût converti de mana. Vous pouvez répéter ce processus autant de fois que vous le souhaitez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quand son travail empiéta sur sa mort, il cessa de l\'appeler l\'œuvre de sa vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d21927-6144-4eef-a0a9-481535edf599\', \'multiverseId\': 188526}, \'multiverseid\': 188526}, {\'name\': \'Ad Nauseam\', \'text\': \'Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio e aggiungila alla tua mano. Perdi punti vita pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta. Puoi ripetere questo procedimento un qualsiasi numero di volte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Quando l\'incarico si trasformò in non morte, smise di chiamarlo il lavoro della sua vita.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d631c2b-99ac-43f3-ad25-00134fab83cf\', \'multiverseId\': 188277}, \'multiverseid\': 188277}, {\'name\': \'むかつき\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開し、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。 あなたはそれの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを失う。あなたはこの手順を望む回数だけ繰り返してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その業が不死の領域に触れるようになってから、彼はそれを一生の仕事と呼ぶことをやめた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471231eb-9f4e-41d1-be78-de9564a2c50e\', \'multiverseId\': 187032}, \'multiverseid\': 187032}, {\'name\': \'Até Enjoar\', \'text\': \'Revele o card do topo de seu grimório e coloque-o na sua mão. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao seu custo de mana convertido. Você pode repetir esse processo quantas vezes desejar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a tarefa passou a envolver até os mortos-vivos, ele parou de chamá-la de "a obra de sua vida".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62175b84-a188-4de3-a1cd-05554b092e47\', \'multiverseId\': 188028}, \'multiverseid\': 188028}, {\'name\': \'До Тошноты\', \'text\': \'Покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки и положите ту карту в вашу руку. Вы теряете количество жизней, равное ее конвертированной мана-стоимости. Вы можете повторять этот процесс сколько угодно раз.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Когда его творение случайно превратилось в нежить, он перестал называть его делом своей жизни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7bd47e8-4ba8-49ca-b8cb-82364e437d71\', \'multiverseId\': 188775}, \'multiverseid\': 188775}, {\'name\': \'倒胃口\', \'text\': \'展示你的牌库顶牌，并将该牌放入你手上。 你失去与该牌之总法术力费用等量的生命。你可将此流程重复进行任意次数。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'当任务在他死后的生涯仍需持续，他便不再称此为「终生使命」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec317aef-04b8-4f43-ab1a-81ea0d578e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 187281}, \'multiverseid\': 187281}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasenkäfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Blasenkäfer ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Krieger des Ripp-Clans tragen ihre Käfersäure-Narben stolz und passen sogar ihre Kleidung und Rüstung an, um sie besser zur Schau stellen zu können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e1d07e9-496b-46c2-bf75-e3c15ca4ba57\', \'multiverseId\': 187533}, \'multiverseid\': 187533}, {\'name\': \'Escarabajo ácido\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Escarabajo ácido entre en juego, la criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Los guerreros del Clan Rip muestran orgullosos su cicatrices de escarabajos ácidos, incluso modificando ropa y armaduras para mostrarlas mejor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f7bad7-ad6b-48af-b87e-7478427fef7b\', \'multiverseId\': 187782}, \'multiverseid\': 187782}, {\'name\': \'Scarabée à phlyctène\', \'text\': "Quand le Scarabée à phlyctène arrive en jeu, la créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Les guerriers du clan de l\'Entaille arborent fièrement leurs cicatrices causées par l\'acide des scarabées, allant même jusqu\'à modifier leurs vêtements et leur armure pour mieux afficher leur trophée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e0c9c7-02f3-4eff-a9c7-33d448c9ffc7\', \'multiverseId\': 188529}, \'multiverseid\': 188529}, {\'name\': \'Cantaride\', \'text\': \'Quando il Cantaride entra in gioco, una creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'I guerrieri del Clan Squarcio mostrano con orgoglio le loro cicatrici da acido di cantaride, anche modificando gli abiti e le armature per far risaltare simili trofei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4212bcdc-e8a6-482c-96ec-466519de0334\', \'multiverseId\': 188280}, \'multiverseid\': 188280}, {\'name\': \'水膨れ虫\', \'text\': \'水膨れ虫が場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'切り裂き隊の戦士はこの虫の酸による傷を誇りとしていて、それを見せるために服や鎧の形を変えることすらある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e44a1831-e288-4567-9262-e194b6a382fe\', \'multiverseId\': 187035}, \'multiverseid\': 187035}, {\'name\': \'Besouro Vesicante\', \'text\': \'Quando Besouro Vesicante entra em jogo, a criatura alvo recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'Os guerreiros do Clã do Corte ostentam com orgulho suas cicatrizes formadas por ácido de besouro, chegando a modificar seus indumentos ou armaduras para exibir melhor o troféu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0ccbbc3-83ae-428f-9190-6c0052d899b4\', \'multiverseId\': 188031}, \'multiverseid\': 188031}, {\'name\': \'Жук-Нарывник\', \'text\': \'Когда Жук-Нарывник входит в игру, целевое существо получает -1/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'Воины Разломного клана гордятся своими шрамами, оставленными едкой кислотой жуков, и даже специально подбирают одежду и доспехи так, чтобы выставить их напоказ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e1cc81a-8248-4716-b9e9-bc0870d34e12\', \'multiverseId\': 188778}, \'multiverseid\': 188778}, {\'name\': \'刺螫甲虫\', \'text\': \'当刺螫甲虫进场时，目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'撕肉族战士以身上的虫酸伤疤为傲，甚至为此修改衣物与铠甲好凸显此类徽章。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60cd611e-ae9f-46b1-9e9f-e11e85db66aa\', \'multiverseId\': 187284}, \'multiverseid\': 187284}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzschleudernde Klauen\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+0 und Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Es wird ziemlich weh tun, aber dafür bist du dann auch schnell tot." —Sedris, König der Verräter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15dc997c-e58d-4251-abef-6efb31d63961\', \'multiverseId\': 187574}, \'multiverseid\': 187574}, {\'name\': \'Garras de relámpago\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+0 y tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Esto va a doler mucho, pero mira el lado positivo: estarás muerto pronto." —Sedris, el Rey Traidor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'319404e6-c4b0-4bb4-9ed3-d20f2836608a\', \'multiverseId\': 187823}, \'multiverseid\': 187823}, {\'name\': "Serres d\'éclair", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+0 et a l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous allez vraiment souffrir, mais voyez le bon côté des choses : vous allez vite mourir. » —Sedris, le Roi traître\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188570&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e15de8-a70c-4b09-bf51-a6f7be3bdd2d\', \'multiverseId\': 188570}, \'multiverseid\': 188570}, {\'name\': \'Artigli Folgoranti\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+0 e ha attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Sarà molto doloroso, ma la cosa positiva è che ben presto sarai morto." —Sedris, il Re Traditore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fa41a6a-88ea-43cc-8407-bbced7a328aa\', \'multiverseId\': 188321}, \'multiverseid\': 188321}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の鉤爪\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「ひどく痛むことになるが、良い方を考えるがいい。死はすぐに来る。」 ――裏切り者の王、セドリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ff6f80-42d7-4a1b-b666-0f883514fb89\', \'multiverseId\': 187076}, \'multiverseid\': 187076}, {\'name\': \'Garras Relampejantes\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+0 e tem iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Isso vai doer muito, mas o lado bom é que você vai morrer bem rápido." — Sedris, o Rei Traidor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ab537a-4569-4f85-bd64-94df7c62cb61\', \'multiverseId\': 188072}, \'multiverseid\': 188072}, {\'name\': \'Когти-Молнии\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+0 и имеет Первый удар.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Будет очень больно, но, к счастью, смерть не заставит себя ждать». — Седрис, король-предатель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961d00e7-d4e3-438c-9e6b-9e6c690fc62e\', \'multiverseId\': 188819}, \'multiverseid\': 188819}, {\'name\': \'闪电利爪\', \'text\': \'生物结界\\n受此结界的生物得+3/+0并具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「这会很痛；但往好处想想，反正你死得也快。」 ～叛徒之王塞基司\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeedd51d-4ca3-4d02-b063-8ac1abb28cbd\', \'multiverseId\': 187325}, \'multiverseid\': 187325}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blut-Kultist\', \'text\': \'{T}: Der Blut-Kultist fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, der in diesem Zug Schaden durch den Blut-Kultist zugefügt wurde, auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blut-Kultist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf die Unsterblichkeit"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187624&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b29f28ca-e8e0-47b1-9bf2-9cc21d9d903a\', \'multiverseId\': 187624}, \'multiverseid\': 187624}, {\'name\': \'Cultista sangrienta\', \'text\': \'{T}: La Cultista sangrienta hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nSiempre que una criatura que haya recibido daño de la Cultista sangrienta este turno vaya a un cementerio, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Cultista sangrienta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"A la inmortalidad."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7254c0d8-c8df-4598-91e5-85d2a4012667\', \'multiverseId\': 187873}, \'multiverseid\': 187873}, {\'name\': \'Cultiste de sang\', \'text\': "{T} : Le Cultiste de sang inflige 1 blessure à la créature ciblée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature ayant subi ce tour-ci des blessures du Cultiste de sang est mise dans un cimetière, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Cultiste de sang.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« À l\'immortalité. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af6c5af-bc9b-4c35-9f56-cd44b29140cd\', \'multiverseId\': 188620}, \'multiverseid\': 188620}, {\'name\': \'Cultista Sanguinaria\', \'text\': \'{T}: La Cultista Sanguinaria infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno dalla Cultista Sanguinaria in questo turno viene messa in un cimitero, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Cultista Sanguinaria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"All\\\'immortalità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'451ab03f-f3c7-47c2-b5b3-8c0987103cab\', \'multiverseId\': 188371}, \'multiverseid\': 188371}, {\'name\': \'血の信者\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。血の信者はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\nこのターン、血の信者によってダメージを与えられたクリーチャーが墓地に置かれるたび、血の信者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「不死に乾杯。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba2d3a70-3382-43e8-a01f-598d19984959\', \'multiverseId\': 187126}, \'multiverseid\': 187126}, {\'name\': \'Cultor de Sangue\', \'text\': \'{T}: Cultor de Sangue causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que sofreu dano causado por Cultor de Sangue neste turno for colocada num cemitério, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Cultor de Sangue.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"À imortalidade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7080dd02-2e74-4cc4-bd3c-66829ec927a3\', \'multiverseId\': 188122}, \'multiverseid\': 188122}, {\'name\': \'Последовательница Культа Крови\', \'text\': \'{T}: Последовательница Культа Крови наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо, которому Последовательница Культа Крови нанесла повреждения в этом ходу, попадает на кладбище, положите на Последовательницу Культа Крови один жетон +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«За бессмертие»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0bae28a-ea4b-40c5-9f4c-1c1a1891b0b8\', \'multiverseId\': 188869}, \'multiverseid\': 188869}, {\'name\': \'血腥教众\', \'text\': \'{T}：血腥教众对目标生物造成1点伤害。\\n每当本回合中曾受到血腥教众伤害的生物置入坟墓场时，在血腥教众上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「敬永生。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a2c5e7-2be0-45fb-9e19-728087a6efcc\', \'multiverseId\': 187375}, \'multiverseid\': 187375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdorn-Stichler\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 5 oder mehr erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Nayas Zelebranten stacheln die Wut der Gargantuas an und lenken deren Fleischmassen mit der Genauigkeit eines Pfeils.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'339d4da8-c0f5-4199-a121-7863e7461546\', \'multiverseId\': 187561}, \'multiverseid\': 187561}, {\'name\': \'Avivadora espina sangrienta\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{T}: La criatura objetivo con fuerza de 5 o más gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los oficiantes de Naya avivan la furia de las gargantúas, liberando una ola de músculos con la precisión de una flecha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f563667d-bd36-43b3-b370-cbc7b43b1a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 187810}, \'multiverseid\': 187810}, {\'name\': \'Taquineuse de ronces hématiques\', \'text\': "Célérité\\n{T} : La créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 5 acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Les célébrants de Naya attisent la rage des gargantuesques, libérant une marée de muscles avec la précision d\'une flèche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188557&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4de4affc-5f4b-4707-b9b3-f28c6b0cdc74\', \'multiverseId\': 188557}, \'multiverseid\': 188557}, {\'name\': \'Istigatrice Spinosa\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\n{T}: Una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 5 ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': "I celebranti di Naya aizzano i mastodonti fino a farli infuriare, scatenando un\'ondata di muscoli con la precisione di una freccia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf26f173-8aae-4443-b69f-e23c313bbe9f\', \'multiverseId\': 188308}, \'multiverseid\': 188308}, {\'name\': \'血茨のなじり屋\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{T}：パワーが５以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤの司祭はガルガンチュアンを焚き付けて怒りを引き出し、矢の正確さで筋肉の波を解き放つ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc66d4b-2b12-43c2-9c9c-401f02ce0700\', \'multiverseId\': 187063}, \'multiverseid\': 187063}, {\'name\': \'Provocadora do Espinho Sanguinário\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\n{T}: A criatura alvo com poder maior ou igual a 5 ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Os celebrantes de Naya incitaram a cólera dos gargantuas, liberando uma onda de músculos com a precisão de uma flecha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb24fef8-cf47-4c1a-9051-f9692cef6f58\', \'multiverseId\': 188059}, \'multiverseid\': 188059}, {\'name\': \'Насмешница Кровавого Терна\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\n{T}: целевое существо с силой 5 или больше получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Найянские празднователи специально разъяряют исполинов, направляя громадные туши против врагов с точностью выпущенной из лука стрелы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07d31c8-ccc1-4411-b4e1-2651020c77d1\', \'multiverseId\': 188806}, \'multiverseid\': 188806}, {\'name\': \'血棘挑发人\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{T}：目标力量大于或等于5的生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'纳雅的仪式主持人挑起巨兽的愤怒，极精准地引导他们狂奔的方向。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c93404-e741-4a93-88b1-4552e9816d50\', \'multiverseId\': 187312}, \'multiverseid\': 187312}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutopferelementar\', \'text\': \'Opfere das Blutopferelementar: Das Blutopferelementar fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu. Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei spielen könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Elementarwesen, die in Jund geboren werden, sind so grausam und instabil wie die Welt selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e679302c-e29b-4043-9376-50e38bdbc254\', \'multiverseId\': 187560}, \'multiverseid\': 187560}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de la pira sangrienta\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Elemental de la pira sangrienta: El Elemental de la pira sangrienta hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Juega esta habilidad sólo cuando puedas jugar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Los elementales nacidos en Jund son tan crueles e inestables como el mismo plano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d2e8ce0-8ec4-4043-9283-aefdb413d12f\', \'multiverseId\': 187809}, \'multiverseid\': 187809}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de sangbrasier\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez l\'Élémental de sangbrasier : L\'Élémental de sangbrasier inflige 4 blessures à la créature ciblée. Ne jouez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez jouer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Les élémentaux de Jund sont aussi cruels et instables que leur plan d\'origine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad65c776-d5c8-4f9e-9e1a-0ba67ab68887\', \'multiverseId\': 188556}, \'multiverseid\': 188556}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Pira Sanguinaria\', \'text\': "Sacrifica l\'Elementale Pira Sanguinaria: L\'Elementale Pira Sanguinaria infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio. Gioca questa abilità solo quando potresti giocare una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Gli elementali nati in Jund sono crudeli e instabili come il piano stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5db46fec-d9e0-496c-8729-0e4e249510ba\', \'multiverseId\': 188307}, \'multiverseid\': 188307}, {\'name\': \'血焚きの精霊\', \'text\': \'血焚きの精霊を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。血焚きの精霊はそれに４点のダメージを与える。 この能力は、あなたがソーサリーをプレイできるときにのみプレイできる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'ジャンドに生まれた精霊は、その次元と同じぐらいに残酷で不安定だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b972216-5758-480c-98c5-5db044b95727\', \'multiverseId\': 187062}, \'multiverseid\': 187062}, {\'name\': \'Elemental da Pira Sanguinária\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Elemental da Pira Sanguinária: Elemental da Pira Sanguinária causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Jogue esta habilidade somente quando puder jogar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Os elementais nascidos de Jund são tão cruéis e instáveis como o próprio plano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'992a5f05-7095-4d15-a1c6-a965bb0fb795\', \'multiverseId\': 188058}, \'multiverseid\': 188058}, {\'name\': \'Элементаль Кровавого Костра\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте Элементаля Кровавого Костра: Элементаль Кровавого Костра наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу. Разыгрывайте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Порожденные Джандом элементали так же жестоки и непостоянны, как и сам мир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbda6b4-8981-4c28-8c3a-a9efc2a240a6\', \'multiverseId\': 188805}, \'multiverseid\': 188805}, {\'name\': \'血祭元素\', \'text\': \'牺牲血祭元素：血祭元素对目标生物造成4点伤害。 你只可以于你能使用法术的时机下使用此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'出生在勇得的元素，正如该时空一般残酷而不稳定。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929f0ece-9daa-4ad5-b314-eaf32ec49342\', \'multiverseId\': 187311}, \'multiverseid\': 187311}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bodensatz-Zombie\', \'text\': \'Exhumieren {B} ({B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie hat Eile. Entferne sie am Ende des Zuges oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde ganz aus dem Spiel. Spiele Exhumieren nur wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Die Untoten in Grixis werden von ihrem Hass auf die Lebenden angetrieben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d82cd33-31f2-49a7-8dbb-a4379a8d7b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 187541}, \'multiverseid\': 187541}, {\'name\': \'Zombie del Escorial\', \'text\': \'Desenterrar {B}. ({B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al juego. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Remuévela del juego al final del turno o si fuera a dejar el juego. Desentierra sólo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Los muertos vivientes de Grixis son impulsados por su odio a los vivos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d00d69b2-2d42-450a-bff2-52e60d1583a6\', \'multiverseId\': 187790}, \'multiverseid\': 187790}, {\'name\': \'Zombie de la Bourbière\', \'text\': "Exhumation {B} ({B} : Renvoyez en jeu cette carte depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Retirez-la de la partie à la fin du tour ou si elle devait quitter le jeu. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez jouer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Les morts-vivants de Grixis sont nourris par leur haine des vivants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ffb6e6-7d36-48ed-a64b-d942a8be9170\', \'multiverseId\': 188537}, \'multiverseid\': 188537}, {\'name\': \'Zombie di Fecciorama\', \'text\': \'Dissotterrare {B} ({B}: Rimetti in gioco questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Rimuovila dal gioco alla fine del turno o se sta per lasciare il gioco. Dissotterra solo quando potresti giocare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'I non morti di Grixis sono alimentati dal loro odio per i vivi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d401ddf1-9b08-4f21-98a0-3f2e2472ba84\', \'multiverseId\': 188288}, \'multiverseid\': 188288}, {\'name\': \'屑肉の地のゾンビ\', \'text\': \'蘇生 {B} ({B}：このカードをあなたの墓地から場に戻す。 それは速攻を得る。 ターン終了時かそれが場を離れる場合にそれをゲームから取り除く。 蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'グリクシスのアンデッドは、生に対する憎悪を糧としている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d824fb39-4a47-4e95-9215-3f1b1010dd3b\', \'multiverseId\': 187043}, \'multiverseid\': 187043}, {\'name\': \'Zumbi do Vale das Escórias\', \'text\': \'Desenterrar {B} ({B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o jogo. Ele ganha ímpeto. Remova-o do jogo no final do turno ou se ele for deixar o jogo. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Os mortos-vivos de Grixis são alimentados pelo ódio que nutrem pelos vivos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df602e3-58af-4423-b415-4a25c4ca1c80\', \'multiverseId\': 188039}, \'multiverseid\': 188039}, {\'name\': \'Зомби Протухшего Болота\', \'text\': \'Откопать {B} ({B}: верните эту карту из вашего кладбища в игру. Она получает Ускорение. Удалите ее из игры в конце хода, или если она должна покинуть игру. Откапывайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Нежить Гриксиса питается своей ненавистью к живым.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'544b8643-b2de-49cb-afcc-ec88b1819306\', \'multiverseId\': 188786}, \'multiverseid\': 188786}, {\'name\': \'渣境灵俑\', \'text\': \'破坟{B} （{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回场上。 它获得敏捷。 于它将离场时，或在回合结束时，将它移出对战。 破坟的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'格利极的不死生物以对生者的恨意为养分。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44e991b3-3ccf-4807-b09d-41cb9debf618\', \'multiverseId\': 187292}, \'multiverseid\': 187292}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogenschützen des Hofes\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nEdelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'Der Sonnige Hof von Valeron befindet sich geschützt hinter einer Mauer aus stählernen Pfeilspitzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345d345b-df22-44cb-a614-dff1bbd8898f\', \'multiverseId\': 187593}, \'multiverseid\': 187593}, {\'name\': \'Arqueros de la corte\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nExaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controles ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero humano\', \'flavor\': \'La Corte Soleada de Valeron está segura detrás de un muro de flechas de punta de acero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'656bb778-9281-4672-858c-37d68f61ef81\', \'multiverseId\': 187842}, \'multiverseid\': 187842}, {\'name\': \'Archers de la cour\', \'text\': "Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nExaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et archer\', \'flavor\': "La Cour Chamarrée de Soleil de Valéron est protégée par un mur de flèches à pointe d\'acier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5125e0ea-25a5-4fd5-aef7-53c93ca5faf6\', \'multiverseId\': 188589}, \'multiverseid\': 188589}, {\'name\': \'Arcieri di Corte\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nEsaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': "La Corte Soleggiata di Valeron è al sicuro dietro un muro di frecce dalla punta d\'acciaio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'619355c1-d602-4300-a76d-cb0143de8810\', \'multiverseId\': 188340}, \'multiverseid\': 188340}, {\'name\': \'宮廷の射手\', \'text\': \'到達 （これは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\n賛美 （あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・射手\', \'flavor\': \'ヴァレロンの斑陽の宮は、鋼の鏃の矢を備えた防壁の影に守られて建っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'272542c1-9665-4791-9d09-4dd86a01f72a\', \'multiverseId\': 187095}, \'multiverseid\': 187095}, {\'name\': \'Arqueiros da Corte\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nExaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'A Corte Ensolarada de Valeron é protegida por um muro de flechas com pontas de aço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'946ec805-08d3-40a4-9b53-6b81321a011f\', \'multiverseId\': 188091}, \'multiverseid\': 188091}, {\'name\': \'Придворные Лучники\', \'text\': \'Захват (Этот объект может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\nПовышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'Залитый Солнцем двор Валерона надежно защищен стеной стрел со стальными наконечниками.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f58bf4b-644c-4bf1-bf6d-ccc9501aab26\', \'multiverseId\': 188838}, \'multiverseid\': 188838}, {\'name\': \'庭园弓箭手\', \'text\': \'延势 （它能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n颂威 （每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'威烈隆的阳饰庭由钢铁箭尖之墙保卫着。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eddb4f8-9b5c-4724-91a3-fb503e18c3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 187344}, \'multiverseid\': 187344}]', "[{'name': 'Bote der Sphinx', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, opfere eine weiße Kreatur, eine blaue Kreatur und eine schwarze Kreatur: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Sphinx-Souverän und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Vedalken, Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Er ruft Rätsel durch die Lücken zwischen gespaltenen Wolken und hofft auf Antwort.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187525&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a22d2bd8-0933-45e7-970a-32c14fe2520e', 'multiverseId': 187525}, 'multiverseid': 187525}, {'name': 'Heraldo de la esfinge', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura blanca, una criatura azul y una criatura negra: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Esfinge soberana y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero vedalken', 'flavor': 'Él lanza un acertijo entre las nubes, esperando una respuesta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187774&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25fec742-e1f9-4f37-98f1-fe65ba9978da', 'multiverseId': 187774}, 'multiverseid': 187774}, {'name': 'Héraut du sphinx', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature blanche, une créature bleue et une créature noire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte nommée Souveraine sphinxiale et mettez-la en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : vedalken et sorcier', 'flavor': 'Il appelle une énigme entre deux nuages en forme de sabot, espérant une réponse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188521&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82affcb0-7ed0-423c-89ea-3df94495fac1', 'multiverseId': 188521}, 'multiverseid': 188521}, {'name': 'Araldo della Sfinge', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura bianca, una creatura blu e una creatura nera: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Sfinge Sovrana e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Vedalken', 'flavor': 'Grida un enigma tra gli spazi vuoti di nubi sparse, nella speranza di ricevere una risposta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188272&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2932570a-66c2-4a11-afc2-8f6dc0e1d8d1', 'multiverseId': 188272}, 'multiverseid': 188272}, {'name': 'スフィンクスの伝令', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, 白のクリーチャー１体と青のクリーチャー１体と黒のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから「スフィンクスの君主」という名前のカードを１枚探し、それを場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ウィザード', 'flavor': '彼は雲の裂け目から謎を呼びかけ、それが答えられることを待つ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187027&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32d85fe4-b2f5-4863-92d7-2517b51f8269', 'multiverseId': 187027}, 'multiverseid': 187027}, {'name': 'Arauto da Esfinge', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, Sacrifique uma criatura branca, uma criatura azul e uma criatura preta: Procure em seu grimório por um card com o nome Soberano da Esfinge e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Vedalkeano Mago', 'flavor': 'Ele lança um enigma por entre nuvens bifurcadas, na esperança de uma resposta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188023&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5127799d-1f23-470b-b05b-4f868837d043', 'multiverseId': 188023}, 'multiverseid': 188023}, {'name': 'Вестник Сфинкса', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, пожертвуйте белое существо, синее существо и черное существо: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Сфинкс-Владыка и положите ее в игру. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Артефактное Существо — Ведалкен Чародей', 'flavor': 'Взывая в просвет меж облаками, он произносит загадку, надеясь получить ответ.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188770&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1efa8679-95b4-4718-b142-e5b6a364a63a', 'multiverseId': 188770}, 'multiverseid': 188770}, {'name': '史芬斯传令', 'text': '{2}{U}，{T}，牺牲一个白色生物，一个蓝色生物，以及一个黑色生物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为史芬斯君王的牌，并将之放置进场。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '神器生物～维多肯／法术师', 'flavor': '他向层云缝隙叫唤着谜题，希望能得到回应。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187276&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '756ad1d5-1c50-4863-bee3-7ee867014344', 'multiverseId': 187276}, 'multiverseid': 187276}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bote des Behemoths\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, opfere eine rote Kreatur, eine grüne Kreatur und eine weiße Kreatur: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Göttervater und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Meiner ist ein unersättlicher Gott, dessen Appetit so vielfältig ist wie der Dschungel selbst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8279dc8-15e5-49e5-bcb6-2867ab11dd7c\', \'multiverseId\': 187591}, \'multiverseid\': 187591}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo del behemot\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura roja, una criatura verde y una criatura blanca: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Ancestro divino y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El mío es un dios insaciable, con un apetito magnífico como la misma selva."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38d2b636-a1f1-46fc-aa74-d08e2b8b6120\', \'multiverseId\': 187840}, \'multiverseid\': 187840}, {\'name\': \'Héraut du béhémoth\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature rouge, une créature verte et une créature blanche : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte nommée Père divin et mettez-la en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Mon dieu a un appétit insatiable, aussi magistral que la jungle. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'523ad69f-d480-43dd-b6f6-ba032690ae62\', \'multiverseId\': 188587}, \'multiverseid\': 188587}, {\'name\': \'Araldo del Behemoth\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura rossa, una creatura verde e una creatura bianca: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Progenitore Divino e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio è un dio insaziabile, con un appetito maestoso come la giungla stessa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b169ff8f-52de-4b13-a364-1d909b82459b\', \'multiverseId\': 188338}, \'multiverseid\': 188338}, {\'name\': \'ビヒモスの伝令\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, 赤のクリーチャー１体と緑のクリーチャー１体と白のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから「神祖」という名前のカードを１枚探し、それを場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「私の神は、ジャングルと同じぐらい満たされることのない飢えを持つ神です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9859d3d-acc6-4b16-b867-58b0972fd97f\', \'multiverseId\': 187093}, \'multiverseid\': 187093}, {\'name\': \'Arauto de Behemoth\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, Sacrifique uma criatura vermelha, uma criatura verde e uma criatura branca: Procure em seu grimório por um card com o nome Sacrogenitor e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"O meu deus é insaciável, com um apetite tão magnificente quanto a própria selva."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8089371-5299-47de-b3c6-b4dcda8f9bc6\', \'multiverseId\': 188089}, \'multiverseid\': 188089}, {\'name\': \'Вестник Чудища\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте красное существо, зеленое существо и белое существо: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Отец Богов и положите ее в игру. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Мой бог ненасытен его аппетит великолепен, как сами джунгли».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5e63c3-009c-42a5-a1ff-6a15a022c262\', \'multiverseId\': 188836}, \'multiverseid\': 188836}, {\'name\': \'贝西摩斯传令\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}，{T}，牺牲一个红色生物，一个绿色生物，以及一个白色生物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为宗神的牌，并将之放置进场。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～地精／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我的主宰是位永不满足的神明，胃口大得有如整座丛林。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cd53110-a5dd-4f80-82d1-7a2b7beb0dff\', \'multiverseId\': 187342}, \'multiverseid\': 187342}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bote des Drachen\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}, opfere eine schwarze Kreatur, eine rote Kreatur und eine grüne Kreatur: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Oberherr der Höllendrachen und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Der vorletzte Schritt des Rituals besteht darin, in einer leckeren Glasur zu baden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187565&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c89c016-f5d4-4f6a-998e-bc65cf5ee0c3\', \'multiverseId\': 187565}, \'multiverseid\': 187565}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo del dragón\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura negra, una criatura roja y una criatura verde: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Engendro supremo y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'El anteúltimo paso del ritual incluye bañarse en una deliciosa salsa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c78477d0-ee36-4aa9-8e64-e733dd12e3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 187814}, \'multiverseid\': 187814}, {\'name\': \'Héraut du dragon\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature noire, une créature rouge et une créature verte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte nommée Suzerain escouflenfer et mettez-la en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "L\'avant-dernière étape du rituel consiste à prendre un bain dans une marinade savoureuse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188561&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b32ecc-9275-4306-9f46-849e9294f217\', \'multiverseId\': 188561}, \'multiverseid\': 188561}, {\'name\': \'Araldo del Drago\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura nera, una creatura rossa e una creatura verde: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Signore Supremo dei Nibbi Infernali e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': "La penultima fase del rituale comprende l\'immergersi in una deliziosa gelatina.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb940c3d-c29d-426b-aeba-c2f7713045b3\', \'multiverseId\': 188312}, \'multiverseid\': 188312}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの伝令\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}, 黒のクリーチャー１体と赤のクリーチャー１体と緑のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから「ヘルカイトの首領」という名前のカードを１枚探し、それを場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'儀式の終わり直前の手順では、美味なる薬液に身体を浸すことになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4b13f9-35a7-4b02-8a57-81bf95a7746c\', \'multiverseId\': 187067}, \'multiverseid\': 187067}, {\'name\': \'Arauto do Dragão\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}, Sacrifique uma criatura preta, uma criatura vermelha e uma criatura verde: Procure em seu grimório por um card com o nome Soberano Dragão Avérneo e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'O penúltimo passo do ritual consiste num delicioso banho vitrificante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c73bd5-9ae0-4184-84b7-239c068ce505\', \'multiverseId\': 188063}, \'multiverseid\': 188063}, {\'name\': \'Вестник Дракона\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}, пожертвуйте черное существо, красное существо и зеленое существо: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Змей-Повелитель и положите ее в игру. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Предпоследний этап ритуала предполагает купание в отменной глазури.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7e13c9a-1407-480d-aaad-5c71662fa335\', \'multiverseId\': 188810}, \'multiverseid\': 188810}, {\'name\': \'巨龙传令\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}，{T}，牺牲一个黑色生物，一个红色生物，以及一个绿色生物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为王龙残虐者的牌，并将之放置进场。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'祭礼的倒数第二个步骤，是在可口的糖汁中沐浴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5da66e1-42bf-4bb4-8cf3-ce86819bc463\', \'multiverseId\': 187316}, \'multiverseid\': 187316}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bote des Dämonen\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, {T}, opfere eine blaue Kreatur, eine schwarze Kreatur und eine rote Kreatur: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Prinz der Knechte und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Tode mögen die ersten von vielen sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70045392-2cb5-4adc-a33e-68b4cdf50d34\', \'multiverseId\': 187539}, \'multiverseid\': 187539}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo del demonio\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura azul, una criatura negra y una criatura roja: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Príncipe de los esclavos y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Que estas muertes sean las primeras de muchas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1977a7b-03dd-4e91-987c-97f61ebdea84\', \'multiverseId\': 187788}, \'multiverseid\': 187788}, {\'name\': \'Héraut du démon\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature bleue, une créature noire et une créature rouge : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte nommée Prince des serviteurs et mettez-la en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Que ces morts soient les premières d\'une longue liste. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188535&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83044c82-1dc3-4366-82b6-1d64879a893b\', \'multiverseId\': 188535}, \'multiverseid\': 188535}, {\'name\': \'Araldo del Demone\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura blu, una creatura nera e una creatura rossa: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Principe degli Schiavi e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Possano queste morti essere le prime di molte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4dbba5e-d778-4f23-81ee-8c47421ddc6a\', \'multiverseId\': 188286}, \'multiverseid\': 188286}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の伝令\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, {T}, 青のクリーチャー１体と黒のクリーチャー１体と赤のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから「束縛の皇子」という名前のカードを１枚探し、それを場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「この死が数多の先駆けとならんことを。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caff12f2-aea4-43e1-a34c-036112e11374\', \'multiverseId\': 187041}, \'multiverseid\': 187041}, {\'name\': \'Arauto do Demônio\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, {T}, Sacrifique uma criatura azul, uma criatura preta e uma criatura vermelha: Procure em seu grimório por um card com o nome Príncipe dos Servos e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Que essas mortes sejam as primeiras de muitas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3048e12-43fb-4642-9e7d-549b45f4f8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 188037}, \'multiverseid\': 188037}, {\'name\': \'Вестник Демона\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, {T}, пожертвуйте синее существо, черное существо и красное существо: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Князь Порабощенных и положите ее в игру. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть эти смерти станут первыми из многих».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27006ea5-62b7-4bce-a7ae-573cebafe791\', \'multiverseId\': 188784}, \'multiverseid\': 188784}, {\'name\': \'恶魔传令\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}，{T}，牺牲一个蓝色生物，一个黑色生物，以及一个红色生物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为尸奴王子的牌，并将之放置进场。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「希望这只是一连串死亡的开头。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c002a9f-e689-41f0-b59c-20dba94a2d20\', \'multiverseId\': 187290}, \'multiverseid\': 187290}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bote des Engels\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, opfere eine grüne Kreatur, eine weiße Kreatur und eine blaue Kreatur: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Himmlischer Erzengel und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Gelegentlich werden fester Glaube und striktes Vertrauen belohnt, dann auch meist reichlich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187469&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8fe287a-45ae-4feb-9677-42b18abf0951\', \'multiverseId\': 187469}, \'multiverseid\': 187469}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo del ángel\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura verde, una criatura blanca y una criatura azul: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Arcángel empíreo y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las creencias rigurosas son ocasionalmente recompensadas, y mucho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cab044ba-43f6-4643-b72d-c75b41050077\', \'multiverseId\': 187718}, \'multiverseid\': 187718}, {\'name\': "Héraut de l\'ange", \'text\': "{2}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature verte, une créature blanche et une créature bleue : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte nommée Archange de l\'empyrée et mettez-la en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'Une foi et une croyance rigoureuses sont parfois récompensées, et ce richement.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de8bcea-83c3-4b14-848a-fc86cbda20bd\', \'multiverseId\': 188465}, \'multiverseid\': 188465}, {\'name\': "Araldo dell\'Angelo", \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura verde, una creatura bianca e una creatura blu: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Arcangelo Empireo e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Una fede e un credo inflessibili vengono premiati di quando in quando... e riccamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa0f9146-125f-4aab-99e2-3b0b9e361a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 188216}, \'multiverseid\': 188216}, {\'name\': \'天使の伝令\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, 緑のクリーチャー１体と白のクリーチャー１体と青のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから「浄火の大天使」という名前のカードを１枚探し、それを場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'厳しい信仰と信心は、時にきわめて豊かに報いられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=186971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4837b022-0d03-43a1-9302-0f7bc736dcaa\', \'multiverseId\': 186971}, \'multiverseid\': 186971}, {\'name\': \'Arauto do Anjo\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, Sacrifique uma criatura verde, uma criatura branca e uma criatura azul: Procure em seu grimório por um card com o nome Arcanjo Empírico e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'A fé e a crença rigorosas são recompensadas no momento certo, e abundantemente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f81d9eb-6319-44d6-a58b-706b6a3d443a\', \'multiverseId\': 187967}, \'multiverseid\': 187967}, {\'name\': \'Вестник Ангела\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, пожертвуйте зеленое существо, белое существо и синее существо: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Архангел Небесного Огня и положите ее в игру. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Строгие убеждения и вера при случае вознаграждаются, и весьма щедро.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2f94de-6beb-4b8c-8a0c-41a8cc3847fd\', \'multiverseId\': 188714}, \'multiverseid\': 188714}, {\'name\': \'天使传令\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}，{T}，牺牲一个绿色生物，一个白色生物，以及一个蓝色生物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为穹光大天使的牌，并将之放置进场。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'严格的忠诚与信念偶尔能获得极丰厚的回报。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f968018a-18da-46d3-aa0b-65d3c2f0008c\', \'multiverseId\': 187220}, \'multiverseid\': 187220}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bösartige Schatten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du die Bösartige Schatten einem Spieler deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen, wie dieser Spieler Karten auf der Hand hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Banden der Urzeiten haben als Geister und Schatten überlebt. Sie warten nur darauf, ihre Klauen in unsere Seelen zu versenken." —Rakka Mar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187586&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c154a359-7e9b-46c1-8a8c-7453ab2d8056\', \'multiverseId\': 187586}, \'multiverseid\': 187586}, {\'name\': \'Sombras perversas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes hacer que las Sombras perversas hagan daño al jugador objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas en la mano de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Las azotadas del pasado todavía permanecen en espíritu, desesperadas por clavar sus garras en nuestras almas." —Rakka Mar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cffb666d-63a1-41b2-abf7-116ec61f2fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 187835}, \'multiverseid\': 187835}, {\'name\': \'Ombres vicieuses\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez faire que les Ombres vicieuses infligent au joueur ciblé un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes dans la main de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Les ombres et les esprits des rosses de jadis sont toujours là, désespérant de pouvoir plonger leurs griffes dans nos âmes. » —Rakka Mar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e8b4578-2423-48b6-a0a5-ce99cfa9daa4\', \'multiverseId\': 188582}, \'multiverseid\': 188582}, {\'name\': \'Ombre Crudeli\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi fare infliggere dalle Ombre Crudeli a un giocatore bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte in mano a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le batoste dell\\\'antico passato permangono in spirito e ombra, con un bisogno disperato di affondare i loro artigli nelle nostre anime." —Rakka Mar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'540efa2b-9b16-4e56-94a4-b3a0fbbf36ff\', \'multiverseId\': 188333}, \'multiverseid\': 188333}, {\'name\': \'不純な影\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体場からいずれかの墓地に置かれるたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは「不純な影はそのプレイヤーに、そのプレイヤーの手札のカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「昔の襲撃団は意志として影の中に未だに息づいていて、私達の魂の奥にまで爪を立てようとしているわね。」 ――ラッカ・マー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df2ad44-235b-4730-9bc0-644a24ab26a4\', \'multiverseId\': 187088}, \'multiverseid\': 187088}, {\'name\': \'Sombras Viciosas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura é colocada no cemitério vinda do jogo, você pode fazer com que Sombras Viciosas cause dano ao jogador alvo igual ao número de cards na mão daquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O espírito e as sombras dos surradores do passado longínquo ainda perambulam por aí, desesperados por enfiar suas garras em nossas almas." — Rakka Mar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9de11bd-ba58-4e7c-86f4-bed3828fa5c1\', \'multiverseId\': 188084}, \'multiverseid\': 188084}, {\'name\': \'Злобные Тени\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо попадает из игры на кладбище, вы можете заставить Злобные Тени нанести повреждения целевому игроку, равные количеству карт в руке того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Стаи из глубокого прошлого не спешат покидать этот мир ни духом, ни тенью, отчаянно желая вцепиться когтями в наши души». — Ракка Мар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e92b6d2e-9a2c-4cf7-bf39-1b3a55163ea2\', \'multiverseId\': 188831}, \'multiverseid\': 188831}, {\'name\': \'恶毒阴影\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物从场上置入坟墓场时，你可以让恶毒阴影对目标牌手造成等同于该牌手之手牌数量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「古老的击族依旧以灵魂与阴影的型态逗留着，亟欲将其利爪刺进我们的灵魂。」 ～拉卡玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de77e4f-2325-461e-8102-e55cdc869aa2\', \'multiverseId\': 187337}, \'multiverseid\': 187337}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cerodon-Bulle\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Bewegungslos hält er Wacht und beobachtet im Stillen Naya durch den dichten weißen Schleier. Wenn er spürt, dass etwas im Argen liegt, stürzt er los und hinterlässt das unheimliche Geräusch zerreißenden Nebels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e122e7a-898c-4252-8b81-43626e26cc44\', \'multiverseId\': 187628}, \'multiverseid\': 187628}, {\'name\': \'Cerodonte macho\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Mantiene una guardia impertérrita, vigilando Naya en silencio detrás de la niebla. Cuando siente algo fuera de lugar, se lanza con el increíble rugir del aire partido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4e975c-c40e-46cb-a5d9-b9676340ee1a\', \'multiverseId\': 187877}, \'multiverseid\': 187877}, {\'name\': \'Cérodon mâle\', \'text\': \'Vigilance, célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Il monte la garde silencieusement, observant Naya au travers de la mante blanche. Dès qu\'il sent quelque chose d\'anormal, il charge avec le fracas assourdissant de la brume qui se lève.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61bf006c-7074-4057-be15-8e3f8588f1b9\', \'multiverseId\': 188624}, \'multiverseid\': 188624}, {\'name\': \'Cornodonte\', \'text\': \'Cautela, rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Veglia immobile, sorvegliando Naya in silenzio attraverso la cortina del manto bianco. Quando percepisce che qualcosa non va, si lancia in avanti con lo straordinario suono di nebbia squarciata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63df9922-d9cd-4814-9f76-2965f0eb2771\', \'multiverseId\': 188375}, \'multiverseid\': 188375}, {\'name\': \'雄きセロドン\', \'text\': \'警戒、速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'白い霞に覆われた中、身動きもせずナヤを静かに見張っている不寝番がいる。 何かを感じると、それは異様な音を立てながら霧を裂き突っ込んでいく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdfb1073-e0ee-498d-86c9-79107df608b8\', \'multiverseId\': 187130}, \'multiverseid\': 187130}, {\'name\': \'Touro Dentócero\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, ímpeto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Ele aguarda imóvel, observando Naya em silêncio através do manto branco. Quando percebe algo de errado, avança com o estrondo sinistro da névoa que se rompe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f035b1e-bfe3-4a28-bae6-21748206c809\', \'multiverseId\': 188126}, \'multiverseid\': 188126}, {\'name\': \'Бык-Рогозуб\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Ускорение\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Он неподвижно стоит наготове, безмолвно наблюдая за просторами Найи сквозь густую пелену белого тумана. Когда он чувствует что-то неладное, он срывается с места так, что слышится жуткий звук раздираемой мглы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3892c8-d894-4dcd-92e6-a1f8d576e0a6\', \'multiverseId\': 188873}, \'multiverseid\': 188873}, {\'name\': \'野蛮角牙兽\', \'text\': \'警戒，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'他文风不动地守着，透过白茫茫的雾气静静看望着纳雅。 一旦感觉到有什么不对劲，便带着划破雾气的怪声向前冲去。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb227738-75f7-43b6-829b-8f20d2e1b857\', \'multiverseId\': 187379}, \'multiverseid\': 187379}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cylianische Elfin\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Auf ihrem Sonnensegel weit über dem Waldboden kann eine Elfen-Lauscherin die Tritte jeder einzelnen Kreatur durch die Geräuschkulisse von Nayas Dschungeln heraushören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'526d2c77-696a-4889-9f43-a8a00d33e0d3\', \'multiverseId\': 187594}, \'multiverseid\': 187594}, {\'name\': \'Elfo cyliano\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Desde su carpa lejos del piso del bosque, un elfo puede oír los pasos de una criatura entre la cacofonía de ruidos de la jungla de Naya.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee35e155-f6d7-40e6-8f3b-8f8abb392f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 187843}, \'multiverseid\': 187843}, {\'name\': \'Elfe cyliane\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Depuis sa tente solevoile tendue haut dans les branches de la forêt, elle peut distinguer les pas d\'une créature dans la cacophonie de sons de la jungle de Naya.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188590&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdde94c8-6149-4922-b606-a99feb180fb0\', \'multiverseId\': 188590}, \'multiverseid\': 188590}, {\'name\': \'Elfa Cylian\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Dalla sua tenda assolata sopra alla foresta, un\'elfa dei richiami può sentire i passi di una creatura tra i suoni cacofonici della giungla di Naya.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee8a9143-c2aa-4b49-b789-936dc3577a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 188341}, \'multiverseid\': 188341}, {\'name\': \'シーリアのエルフ\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'森の底から高いところにある陽を浴びるテントで、エルフの見張りはナヤのジャングルの不協和音の中から生き物一匹の足音を聞き分ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4671bd88-02db-4474-803c-3beda4197f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 187096}, \'multiverseid\': 187096}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Cyliano\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'De sua tenda ensolarada muito acima do chão da floresta, uma elfa auscultadora pode ouvir os passos até mesmo de uma única criatura no meio da cacofonia da selva de Naya.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48011615-2eb4-4c34-88b6-318815b386a0\', \'multiverseId\': 188092}, \'multiverseid\': 188092}, {\'name\': \'Силийский Эльф\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Из своей защищающей от солнца палатки высоко над землей прислушивающаяся эльфийка может различить звук шагов каждого отдельного существа в разноголосии джунглей Найи.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74a53ea6-edc8-4621-a619-a3b98197a0ae\', \'multiverseId\': 188839}, \'multiverseid\': 188839}, {\'name\': \'塞利亚地精\', \'type\': \'生物～地精／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'地精在离地甚远的高处搭建帐篷，在纳雅的丛林声响之中，每个生物的足声杂音都躲不过地精的耳朵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2970191-a2f2-4222-b44f-1651eafa7959\', \'multiverseId\': 187345}, \'multiverseid\': 187345}]', '[{\'name\': \'Deutliches Ultimatum\', \'text\': \'Bestimme fünf bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst. Für jede dieser bleibenden Karten kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte mit dem gleichen Namen wie diese bleibende Karte durchsuchen. Bringe diese Karten getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Bist du erst einmal eines Segens würdig, werden bald viele weitere folgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f04fae1-b795-4e0c-8afe-2454237ff252\', \'multiverseId\': 187630}, \'multiverseid\': 187630}, {\'name\': \'Ultimátum estentóreo\', \'text\': \'Elige cinco permanentes que controles. Por cada uno de esos permanentes, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta con el mismo nombre que ese permanente. Pon en juego giradas esas cartas, luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Si eres merecedor de una bendición, otras la seguirán.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ac5eb1-3ad2-4568-ade2-14ebcb17a63d\', \'multiverseId\': 187879}, \'multiverseid\': 187879}, {\'name\': \'Ultimatum claironnant\', \'text\': \'Choisissez cinq permanents que vous contrôlez. Pour chacun de ces permanents, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte ayant le même nom que ce permanent. Mettez ces cartes en jeu engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Sois digne d\'une bénédiction, et d\'autres suivront.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188626&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3150f052-79e8-44b1-a6cf-5bfcb438337c\', \'multiverseId\': 188626}, \'multiverseid\': 188626}, {\'name\': \'Ultimatum Squillante\', \'text\': \'Scegli cinque permanenti che controlli. Per ognuno di quei permanenti, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta con lo stesso nome di quel permanente. Metti quelle carte in gioco TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Dimostrati degno di una sola benedizione e molte altre ne seguiranno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c89751-b4c4-4398-b307-11c800f49815\', \'multiverseId\': 188377}, \'multiverseid\': 188377}, {\'name\': \'朗々たる根本原理\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするパーマネントを５つ選ぶ。 それらのパーマネント１つにつき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーからそのパーマネントと同じ名前を持つカードを１枚探してもよい。 それらのカードをタップ状態で場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'一つの祝福に値する者となるべし。されば多くがその後に続くであろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'060304b2-a813-4f9a-ac45-d7128fb34750\', \'multiverseId\': 187132}, \'multiverseid\': 187132}, {\'name\': \'Ultimato do Clarão\', \'text\': \'Escolha cinco permanentes que você controla. Para cada uma dessas permanentes, você pode procurar em seu grimório por um card com o mesmo nome daquela permanente. Coloque esses cards em jogo virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Seja digno de uma única bênção e muitas outras virão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1430aaa7-26e9-4e83-93bf-6c1eb0c12c72\', \'multiverseId\': 188128}, \'multiverseid\': 188128}, {\'name\': \'Призывный Ультиматум\', \'text\': \'Выберите пять перманентов под вашим контролем. Для каждого из тех перманентов вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту с тем же именем, что и у того перманента. Положите те карты в игру повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Будь достоин одной медали, и ты заслужишь великое множество.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcf81106-0012-4eaf-a675-d92c9fea0222\', \'multiverseId\': 188875}, \'multiverseid\': 188875}, {\'name\': \'号召通牒\', \'text\': \'选择五个由你操控的永久物。 对每一个这类永久物而言，你可以分别从你的牌库中搜寻一张与该永久物同名的牌。 将那些牌横置进场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'若有资格领受祝福，就将能领受更多祝福。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbb62e5-25d8-495d-bff9-3efccf4c7598\', \'multiverseId\': 187381}, \'multiverseid\': 187381}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donner der Hölle\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nOpfere den Donner der Hölle am Ende des Zuges.\\nExhumieren {4}{R} ({4}{R}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie hat Eile. Entferne sie am Ende des Zuges oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde ganz aus dem Spiel. Spiele Exhumieren nur wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'011ce1c2-ac93-4334-b98e-7ffd917ed80c\', \'multiverseId\': 187570}, \'multiverseid\': 187570}, {\'name\': \'Trueno del infierno\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nAl final del turno, sacrifica el Trueno del infierno.\\nDesenterrar {4}{R}. ({4}{R}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al juego. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Remuévela del juego al final del turno o si fuera a dejar el juego. Desentierra sólo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'585a32d4-8e0c-486f-b785-36574b62a503\', \'multiverseId\': 187819}, \'multiverseid\': 187819}, {\'name\': "Tonnerre de l\'enfer", \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ la fin du tour, sacrifiez le Tonnerre de l\'enfer.\\nExhumation {4}{R} ({4}{R} : Renvoyez en jeu cette carte depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Retirez-la de la partie à la fin du tour ou si elle devait quitter le jeu. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez jouer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a44ff5-d92a-4b63-b439-f4dd21b9b01d\', \'multiverseId\': 188566}, \'multiverseid\': 188566}, {\'name\': \'Tuono Infernale\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\nAlla fine del turno, sacrifica il Tuono Infernale.\\nDissotterrare {4}{R} ({4}{R}:Rimetti in gioco questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Rimuovila dal gioco alla fine del turno o se sta per lasciare il gioco. Dissotterra solo quando potresti giocare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa3b689b-a15b-4eda-a3fc-b78963668005\', \'multiverseId\': 188317}, \'multiverseid\': 188317}, {\'name\': \'地獄の雷\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\nターン終了時に、地獄の雷を生け贄に捧げる。\\n蘇生 {4}{R} ({4}{R}：このカードをあなたの墓地から場に戻す。 それは速攻を得る。 ターン終了時かそれが場を離れる場合にそれをゲームから取り除く。 蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd928a86-30e6-48b1-af47-87256fdba555\', \'multiverseId\': 187072}, \'multiverseid\': 187072}, {\'name\': \'Trovão Infernal\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nNo final do turno, sacrifique Trovão Infernal.\\nDesenterrar {4}{R} ({4}{R}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o jogo. Ele ganha ímpeto. Remova-o do jogo no final do turno ou se ele for deixar o jogo. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23a6172-dde4-40f3-8c69-062ce9fe67fc\', \'multiverseId\': 188068}, \'multiverseid\': 188068}, {\'name\': \'Адский Громовержец\', \'text\': \'Полет, Ускорение\\nВ конце хода пожертвуйте Адского Громовержца.\\nОткопать {4}{R} ({4}{R}: верните эту карту из вашего кладбища в игру. Она получает Ускорение. Удалите ее из игры в конце хода, или если она должна покинуть игру. Откапывайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eda6a554-7110-4430-a888-f48afe69a764\', \'multiverseId\': 188815}, \'multiverseid\': 188815}, {\'name\': \'狱雷妖\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n在回合结束时，牺牲狱雷妖。\\n破坟{4}{R} （{4}{R}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回场上。 它获得敏捷。 于它将离场时，或在回合结束时，将它移出对战。 破坟的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a9dd861-0942-41ef-be4f-996d03aba339\', \'multiverseId\': 187321}, \'multiverseid\': 187321}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenfutter\', \'text\': \'Bringe zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins wandern immer zu zweit zu den Gipfeln der Opferung, damit der gelegentliche Überlebende vom Untergang des anderen berichten kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cbc9c50-19a2-4963-8ff2-815afb8e48a8\', \'multiverseId\': 187564}, \'multiverseid\': 187564}, {\'name\': \'Carnada para dragones\', \'text\': \'Pon en juego dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos viajan a los picos de sacrificio en parejas, de manera tal que si hay un superviviente pueda contar los detalles del fallecimiento del otro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0555462d-2836-4e71-94fe-7cd176bceaa2\', \'multiverseId\': 187813}, \'multiverseid\': 187813}, {\'name\': \'Chair à dragon\', \'text\': \'Mettez en jeu deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les gobelins se rendent sur les pics sacrificiels par deux pour que l\'éventuel survivant puisse relater les détails de l\'horrible fin de l\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c6a7581-69eb-4f95-bd12-22acd6af5a19\', \'multiverseId\': 188560}, \'multiverseid\': 188560}, {\'name\': \'Spuntino del Drago\', \'text\': \'Metti in gioco due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I goblin viaggiano fino alle vette sacrificali in coppia così che i rari sopravvissuti siano in grado di riferire i dettagli della macabra dipartita del compagno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baca5c7b-21b2-4c75-a40f-84cf13d713ee\', \'multiverseId\': 188311}, \'multiverseid\': 188311}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの餌\', \'text\': \'赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを２体場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'贄の峠へと旅に出るとき、ゴブリンは必ず二人で行く。稀に、生き残った方が、もう一方の悲惨な最期を語ることができるかもしれないからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77b13f91-23c8-482c-ba99-a5e819c9c34a\', \'multiverseId\': 187066}, \'multiverseid\': 187066}, {\'name\': \'Forragem de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Coloque em jogo duas fichas de criatura vermelhas 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os goblins fazem a travessia até os picos do sacrifício em pares, de forma que um eventual sobrevivente possa contar os detalhes do horripilante fim do outro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dfe6558-ecb4-41c1-b732-ba6eebe3dc26\', \'multiverseId\': 188062}, \'multiverseid\': 188062}, {\'name\': \'Драконий Корм\', \'text\': \'Положите в игру две фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Гоблины всегда отправляются к местам жертвоприношения парами, чтобы выживший счастливчик мог поведать о страшной кончине товарища.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7b9f931-181b-4447-91dc-84f583e19d91\', \'multiverseId\': 188809}, \'multiverseid\': 188809}, {\'name\': \'巨龙食粮\', \'text\': \'将两个1/1红色精灵衍生物放置进场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'精灵前往牺牲山峰的旅程总是两两结伴同行，好让极幸运的生还者能讲述另一人的悲惨死法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c368bd-aaa7-4bb8-9719-3f3fe13b19e6\', \'multiverseId\': 187315}, \'multiverseid\': 187315}]', '[{\'name\': \'Druide der Anima\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}, {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl die Anima selbst im Sacellum verbleibt, durchforsten ihre Druiden Naya und sammeln Manaverbindungen zu jedem Ort auf der Welt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a45ca50-e77b-48c6-88c1-e35d3f5fbab3\', \'multiverseId\': 187595}, \'multiverseid\': 187595}, {\'name\': \'Druida del Ánima\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}, {G}, o {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque el Ánima permanece en Sacellum, sus druidas vagan por Naya, recolectando uniones de maná con cada lugar del mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c9a654-00af-450a-bd5b-25ba90626a21\', \'multiverseId\': 187844}, \'multiverseid\': 187844}, {\'name\': "Druidesse de l\'Anima", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {G} ou {W} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "Même si l\'Anima demeure au Sacellum, ses druides parcourent Naya pour récolter des liens de mana dans tous les lieux du monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f40251-6506-4c9a-9185-e3f3315ed645\', \'multiverseId\': 188591}, \'multiverseid\': 188591}, {\'name\': "Druida dell\'Anima", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R}, {G} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Sebbene l\'Anima stessa rimanga nel Sacello, i suoi druidi perlustrano Naya, raccogliendo vincoli di mana con ogni luogo del mondo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eafaa4c8-c49d-4416-89c7-b0f66587737e\', \'multiverseId\': 188342}, \'multiverseid\': 188342}, {\'name\': \'アニマのドルイド\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'アニマ自身はサシーリウムの中に残っているが、彼女に仕えるドルイドはナヤに広まり、世界中のあらゆる場所の魔力を集めている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74cfc445-b0fe-4df1-a5fa-9ed159dd8389\', \'multiverseId\': 187097}, \'multiverseid\': 187097}, {\'name\': \'Druida de Anima\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {R}, {G} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Embora a própria Anima permaneça no Sacellum, seus druidas vagam por Naya, coletando elos de mana com todos os outros locais do mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325f0fba-88b1-432a-bf50-d2215ee1f447\', \'multiverseId\': 188093}, \'multiverseid\': 188093}, {\'name\': \'Друид Анимы\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {R}, {G} или {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'И хотя сама Анима остается в Сацеллуме, ее друиды бродят по Найе, собирая источники маны, связывающие их даже с самыми удаленными местами по всему миру.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77753626-3294-4fd0-9b87-2b0c95f03795\', \'multiverseId\': 188840}, \'multiverseid\': 188840}, {\'name\': \'谕灵的德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}，{G}，或{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～地精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'谕灵虽然身处藤圣堂，但旗下的德鲁伊在纳雅四处出没，收集世界各处的魔力连结。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43242d0-3b38-46bb-9fb8-19f68a085bc0\', \'multiverseId\': 187346}, \'multiverseid\': 187346}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dröhnende Stille\', \'text\': \'Entferne eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl ganz aus dem Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {5}{G}{W}{U} ({5}{G}{W}{U}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du die Dröhnende Stille umwandelst, entferne bis zu zwei angreifende Kreaturen deiner Wahl ganz aus dem Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28876bca-34e8-4ff6-bf2b-11d284ddfe14\', \'multiverseId\': 187489}, \'multiverseid\': 187489}, {\'name\': \'Silencio resonante\', \'text\': \'Remueve del juego la criatura atacante objetivo.\\nCiclo {5}{G}{W}{U}. ({5}{G}{W}{U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Silencio resonante, remueve del juego hasta dos criaturas atacantes objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473cdd17-c633-40b8-807f-792b69026c47\', \'multiverseId\': 187738}, \'multiverseid\': 187738}, {\'name\': \'Silence retentissant\', \'text\': "Retirez la créature attaquante ciblée de la partie.\\nRecyclage {5}{G}{W}{U} ({5}{G}{W}{U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Silence retentissant, retirez de la partie jusqu\'à deux créatures attaquantes ciblées.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0326f0ea-fc52-4e0b-89fd-9defb8e61c67\', \'multiverseId\': 188485}, \'multiverseid\': 188485}, {\'name\': \'Silenzio Echeggiante\', \'text\': \'Rimuovi dal gioco una creatura attaccante bersaglio.\\nCiclo {5}{G}{W}{U} ({5}{G}{W}{U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Silenzio Echeggiante, rimuovi dal gioco fino a due creature attaccanti bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a399ae-2cd0-46bd-bdd0-b21b37e2ab86\', \'multiverseId\': 188236}, \'multiverseid\': 188236}, {\'name\': \'圧倒する静寂\', \'text\': \'攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをゲームから取り除く。\\nサイクリング {5}{G}{W}{U} （{5}{G}{W}{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが圧倒する静寂をサイクリングしたとき、攻撃しているクリーチャーを最大２体まで対象とし、それらをゲームから取り除く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=186991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0174fe9-4479-428e-8900-d4d7128528a8\', \'multiverseId\': 186991}, \'multiverseid\': 186991}, {\'name\': \'Silêncio Ressonante\', \'text\': \'Remova do jogo a criatura alvo atacante.\\nReciclar {5}{G}{W}{U} ({5}{G}{W}{U}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando reciclar Silêncio Ressonante, remova do jogo até duas criaturas alvo atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11d52600-861a-4017-9005-ff134d2dcef8\', \'multiverseId\': 187987}, \'multiverseid\': 187987}, {\'name\': \'Гулкая Тишина\', \'text\': \'Удалите целевое атакующее существо из игры.\\nЦикл {5}{G}{W}{U} ({5}{G}{W}{U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Гулкой Тишины, удалите из игры не более двух целевых атакующих существ.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20fc34d4-10a7-430d-9fc0-89d53fb208ed\', \'multiverseId\': 188734}, \'multiverseid\': 188734}, {\'name\': \'轰然静寂\', \'text\': \'将目标进行攻击的生物移出对战。\\n循环{5}{G}{W}{U} （{5}{G}{W}{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环轰然静寂时，将至多两个目标进行攻击的生物移出对战。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7f57bbc-ca4e-4b9d-8d4c-3d55f38648cd\', \'multiverseId\': 187240}, \'multiverseid\': 187240}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dröhnende Welle\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nUmwandlung {5}{W}{U}{B} ({5}{W}{U}{B}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du die Dröhnende Welle umwandelst, bringe zwei bleibende Karten deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdcd6d26-54ef-4622-bba6-9662f9edac81\', \'multiverseId\': 187521}, \'multiverseid\': 187521}, {\'name\': \'Ola resonante\', \'text\': \'Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\nCiclo {5}{W}{U}{B}. ({5}{W}{U}{B}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo de la Ola resonante, regresa dos permanentes objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc1f125-04db-436a-9cf9-0232793b7d99\', \'multiverseId\': 187770}, \'multiverseid\': 187770}, {\'name\': \'Vague retentissante\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nRecyclage {5}{W}{U}{B} ({5}{W}{U}{B}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez la Vague retentissante, renvoyez deux permanents ciblés dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188517&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8431fde-a92e-47f0-876f-76b7890a1f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 188517}, \'multiverseid\': 188517}, {\'name\': \'Onda Echeggiante\', \'text\': "Fai tornare un permanente bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\nCiclo {5}{W}{U}{B} ({5}{W}{U}{B}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli l\'Onda Echeggiante, fai tornare due permanenti bersaglio in mano ai loro proprietari.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d1c140-fe8e-4c16-98b1-66f1c8c698df\', \'multiverseId\': 188268}, \'multiverseid\': 188268}, {\'name\': \'圧倒する波\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nサイクリング {5}{W}{U}{B} （{5}{W}{U}{B}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが圧倒する波をサイクリングしたとき、パーマネント２つを対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360df068-5bbd-4c93-8764-96285d54fcfa\', \'multiverseId\': 187023}, \'multiverseid\': 187023}, {\'name\': \'Onda Ressonante\', \'text\': \'Devolva a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono.\\nReciclar {5}{W}{U}{B} ({5}{W}{U}{B}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você reciclar Onda Ressonante, devolva duas permanentes alvo para a mão de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61a56cc5-60ae-4905-bb0e-d4da5b9addf4\', \'multiverseId\': 188019}, \'multiverseid\': 188019}, {\'name\': \'Гулкая Волна\', \'text\': \'Верните целевой перманент в руку его владельца.\\nЦикл {5}{W}{U}{B} ({5}{W}{U}{B}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Гулкой Волны, верните два целевых перманента в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb7762b0-461c-4886-8620-b87402729ef5\', \'multiverseId\': 188766}, \'multiverseid\': 188766}, {\'name\': \'轰然浪潮\', \'text\': \'将目标永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n循环{5}{W}{U}{B} （{5}{W}{U}{B}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环轰然浪潮时，将两个目标永久物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea5ae9b-04f2-4241-ad30-7c7575f4762c\', \'multiverseId\': 187272}, \'multiverseid\': 187272}]', "[{'name': 'Dröhnender Donner', 'text': 'Der Dröhnende Donner fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nUmwandlung {5}{B}{R}{G} ({5}{B}{R}{G}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Dröhnenden Donner umwandelst, fügt er einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 6 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187577&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88fe11de-9677-4a30-9d20-21ef45a4e7a2', 'multiverseId': 187577}, 'multiverseid': 187577}, {'name': 'Trueno resonante', 'text': 'El Trueno resonante hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\nCiclo {5}{B}{R}{G}. ({5}{B}{R}{G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Trueno resonante, éste le hace 6 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187826&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03890cb1-0557-4b8e-81e2-fe5751d43167', 'multiverseId': 187826}, 'multiverseid': 187826}, {'name': 'Tonnerre retentissant', 'text': 'Le Tonnerre retentissant inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nRecyclage {5}{B}{R}{G} ({5}{B}{R}{G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Tonnerre retentissant, il inflige 6 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188573&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f793a0bc-8003-40cf-a285-9e05545e6b69', 'multiverseId': 188573}, 'multiverseid': 188573}, {'name': 'Tuono Echeggiante', 'text': 'Il Tuono Echeggiante infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nCiclo {5}{B}{R}{G} ({5}{B}{R}{G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Tuono Echeggiante, infligge 6 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188324&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e691dfb4-b716-43eb-a690-5de774ec75dc', 'multiverseId': 188324}, 'multiverseid': 188324}, {'name': '圧倒する雷', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。圧倒する雷はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング {5}{B}{R}{G} （{5}{B}{R}{G}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが圧倒する雷をサイクリングしたとき、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。圧倒する雷はそれに６点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187079&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbb32b5d-7b9c-4461-8010-8df942df182f', 'multiverseId': 187079}, 'multiverseid': 187079}, {'name': 'Trovão Ressonante', 'text': 'Trovão Ressonante causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\nReciclar {5}{B}{R}{G} ({5}{B}{R}{G}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Trovão Ressonante, ele causa 6 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188075&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de48094a-9d25-494c-9a76-db9d16ec4404', 'multiverseId': 188075}, 'multiverseid': 188075}, {'name': 'Гулкий Гром', 'text': 'Гулкий Гром наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\\nЦикл {5}{B}{R}{G} ({5}{B}{R}{G}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Гулкого Грома, он наносит 6 повреждений целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188822&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ed9dda0-f3fc-4530-a575-c7ead731da72', 'multiverseId': 188822}, 'multiverseid': 188822}, {'name': '轰然雷鸣', 'text': '轰然雷鸣对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\\n循环{5}{B}{R}{G} （{5}{B}{R}{G}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环轰然雷鸣时，它对目标生物或牌手造成6点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187328&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fef3aee8-0c5d-4112-95d9-9e5724f7cfa0', 'multiverseId': 187328}, 'multiverseid': 187328}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dröhnender Schrei\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft eine zufällig bestimmte Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\\nUmwandlung {5}{U}{B}{R} ({5}{U}{B}{R}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Dröhnenden Schrei umwandelst, wirft ein Spieler deiner Wahl zwei zufällig bestimmte Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16bff24-3a4f-48aa-b0d4-bbba813f408c\', \'multiverseId\': 187550}, \'multiverseid\': 187550}, {\'name\': \'Grito resonante\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo descarta una carta al azar.\\nCiclo {5}{U}{B}{R}. ({5}{U}{B}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Grito resonante, el jugador objetivo descarta dos cartas al azar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3233a644-d8b1-4267-bf9c-656cc3d96ec5\', \'multiverseId\': 187799}, \'multiverseid\': 187799}, {\'name\': \'Cri retentissant\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé se défausse d\'un carte au hasard.\\nRecyclage {5}{U}{B}{R} ({5}{U}{B}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Cri retentissant, le joueur ciblé se défausse de deux cartes au hasard.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd817862-e4ea-4bf5-98ad-9640f3990cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 188546}, \'multiverseid\': 188546}, {\'name\': \'Urlo Echeggiante\', \'text\': "Un giocatore bersaglio scarta una carta a caso.\\nCiclo {5}{U}{B}{R} ({5}{U}{B}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli l\'Urlo Echeggiante, un giocatore bersaglio scarta due carte a caso.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb73b1d-e982-4137-a946-7efc0ca2fb97\', \'multiverseId\': 188297}, \'multiverseid\': 188297}, {\'name\': \'圧倒する叫び\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚無作為に選んで捨てる。\\nサイクリング {5}{U}{B}{R} （{5}{U}{B}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが圧倒する叫びをサイクリングしたとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚無作為に選んで捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d58e10-9ff4-4758-907b-a793f1aaed5d\', \'multiverseId\': 187052}, \'multiverseid\': 187052}, {\'name\': \'Grito Ressonante\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo descarta um card aleatoriamente.\\nReciclar {5}{U}{B}{R} ({5}{U}{B}{R}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Grito Ressonante, o jogador alvo descarta dois cards aleatoriamente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e64eda-36f3-482c-874f-f10f17d073d7\', \'multiverseId\': 188048}, \'multiverseid\': 188048}, {\'name\': \'Гулкий Крик\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок сбрасывает случайно выбранную карту.\\nЦикл {5}{U}{B}{R} ({5}{U}{B}{R}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Гулкого Крика, целевой игрок сбрасывает две случайно выбранные карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d5dbfd-507c-42f4-b4ff-12784258c47d\', \'multiverseId\': 188795}, \'multiverseid\': 188795}, {\'name\': \'轰然嘶喊\', \'text\': \'目标牌手随机弃一张牌。\\n循环{5}{U}{B}{R} （{5}{U}{B}{R}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环轰然嘶喊时，目标牌手随机弃两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cbf8d7a-4115-4de5-b879-3b6414c49d2c\', \'multiverseId\': 187301}, \'multiverseid\': 187301}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dröhnendes Brüllen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nUmwandlung {5}{R}{G}{W} ({5}{R}{G}{W}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dröhnende Brüllen umwandelst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +6/+6 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7df7c7b-fd1d-4c6d-afe8-d08099a57d73\', \'multiverseId\': 187611}, \'multiverseid\': 187611}, {\'name\': \'Rugido resonante\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\\nCiclo {5}{R}{G}{W}. ({5}{R}{G}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Rugido resonante, la criatura objetivo obtiene +6/+6 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ccc7ac1-0916-4b5d-b18e-fd1c1cc76f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 187860}, \'multiverseid\': 187860}, {\'name\': \'Rugissement retentissant\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nRecyclage {5}{R}{G}{W} ({5}{R}{G}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Rugissement retentissant, la créature ciblée gagne +6/+6 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188607&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a41354-b498-45f1-923b-c595dc342fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 188607}, \'multiverseid\': 188607}, {\'name\': \'Ruggito Echeggiante\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\\nCiclo {5}{R}{G}{W} ({5}{R}{G}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Ruggito Echeggiante, una creatura bersaglio prende +6/+6 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9147e30f-33b2-441d-8f19-a2372aef92ce\', \'multiverseId\': 188358}, \'multiverseid\': 188358}, {\'name\': \'圧倒する咆哮\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nサイクリング {5}{R}{G}{W} （{5}{R}{G}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが圧倒する咆哮をサイクリングしたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋６/＋６の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e29c48-4f6e-442a-bffb-577c585b36de\', \'multiverseId\': 187113}, \'multiverseid\': 187113}, {\'name\': \'Rugido Ressonante\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno.\\nReciclar {5}{R}{G}{W} ({5}{R}{G}{W}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Rugido Ressonante, a criatura alvo recebe +6/+6 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06deef99-1122-425d-9254-30ac417c814d\', \'multiverseId\': 188109}, \'multiverseid\': 188109}, {\'name\': \'Гулкий Рык\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+3 до конца хода.\\nЦикл {5}{R}{G}{W} ({5}{R}{G}{W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Гулкого Рыка, целевое существо получает +6/+6 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65dc04bd-f0cc-45de-8c04-f78855f9668d\', \'multiverseId\': 188856}, \'multiverseid\': 188856}, {\'name\': \'轰然怒吼\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。\\n循环{5}{R}{G}{W} （{5}{R}{G}{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环轰然怒吼时，目标生物得+6/+6直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862da281-1230-479e-a5af-a35680945616\', \'multiverseId\': 187362}, \'multiverseid\': 187362}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dschungelschrein\', \'text\': \'Der Dschungelschrein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}, {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In Naya sind Ehrgeiz und Verrat selten geworden, fast ausgerottet von der Ehrfurcht, die dort den irdischen Göttern entgegengebracht wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187693&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d63edd98-c296-4000-9ca7-456530a78fbc\', \'multiverseId\': 187693}, \'multiverseid\': 187693}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la jungla\', \'text\': \'El Altar de la jungla entra en juego girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}, {G}, o {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En Naya, la ambición y la traición no son corrientes, llevadas casi a la extinción por la veneración a los dioses terrestres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d2edf4-38e6-4eac-bd66-d9cd0818909b\', \'multiverseId\': 187942}, \'multiverseid\': 187942}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire de la jungle\', \'text\': \'Le Reliquaire de la jungle arrive en jeu engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {G} ou {W} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sur Naya, l\'ambition et la traîtrise sont rares. La dévotion aux divinités terrestres les ont presque portées à l\'extinction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188689&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caa0f887-df1c-45d5-9683-fe37623d6548\', \'multiverseId\': 188689}, \'multiverseid\': 188689}, {\'name\': \'Santuario nella Giungla\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario nella Giungla entra in gioco TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}, {G} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "In Naya, l\'ambizione e il tradimento sono rari, cacciati quasi fino all\'estinzione dal timore reverenziale dimostrato verso gli dei terreni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cefb524-fb66-42ca-8a81-a9c70051c854\', \'multiverseId\': 188440}, \'multiverseid\': 188440}, {\'name\': \'ジャングルの祭殿\', \'text\': \'ジャングルの祭殿はタップ状態で場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤでは、地上の神への畏怖から、野心や裏切りは絶滅に近いほど狩りつくされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92caedcc-c458-456e-a040-0bec544108b7\', \'multiverseId\': 187195}, \'multiverseid\': 187195}, {\'name\': \'Sacrário da Selva\', \'text\': \'Sacrário da Selva entra em jogo virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}, {G} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Em Naya, a ambição e a traição são raras, pois foram caçadas até sua extinção pelo respeito devido aos deuses terrestres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80df19c-414c-4c34-ac91-4f36bb554096\', \'multiverseId\': 188191}, \'multiverseid\': 188191}, {\'name\': \'Святыня Джунглей\', \'text\': \'Святыня Джунглей входит в игру повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}, {G} или {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'На Найе редко встречаются честолюбие и предательство, доведенные до грани исчезновения благоговейным страхом пред земными богами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9668b548-c724-41b3-a1a0-ecd7d2ed9523\', \'multiverseId\': 188938}, \'multiverseid\': 188938}, {\'name\': \'丛林祭祠\', \'text\': \'丛林祭祠须横置进场。\\n{T}：加{R}，{G}，或{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'野心与背叛在纳雅并不常见，早已被对现世神明的崇敬猎捕得近乎灭绝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c9f4430-92d3-452c-86ab-bc31f6b2008f\', \'multiverseId\': 187444}, \'multiverseid\': 187444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dschungelweber\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Die Netze der Weber trennen Gebiete effektiver ab als Fallgitter aus Eisen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54f61eeb-2a39-40ab-a020-8dede355d298\', \'multiverseId\': 187601}, \'multiverseid\': 187601}, {\'name\': \'Tejedora de la jungla\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Las redes de las tejedoras marcan el territorio mucho mejor que un portón de hierro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c22ab81-ae32-4575-93d1-825b731347b1\', \'multiverseId\': 187850}, \'multiverseid\': 187850}, {\'name\': \'Tisseur de jungle\', \'text\': \'Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Les toiles des tisseurs bloquent les territoires plus efficacement qu\'une herse de fer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188597&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b7dce5-dc1e-4311-ac84-e168adbcbe83\', \'multiverseId\': 188597}, \'multiverseid\': 188597}, {\'name\': \'Tessitore della Giungla\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Le ragnatele dei tessitori separano zone di territorio più efficacemente di qualsiasi saracinesca di ferro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc2f46ac-9544-4c6e-bba4-f651c283af66\', \'multiverseId\': 188348}, \'multiverseid\': 188348}, {\'name\': \'ジャングルの織り手\', \'text\': \'到達 （これは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\nサイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'織り手の巣は、自身の縄張り全域を鉄の落とし格子よりも効果的に覆っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c915b454-313c-4750-8157-36f7e4dd82a3\', \'multiverseId\': 187103}, \'multiverseid\': 187103}, {\'name\': \'Tecelã da Selva\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'As teias das tecelãs circundam uma área do terreno com maior eficácia do que os portões levadiços feitos de ferro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d961f45a-45b8-432a-9cf1-2b49e8cdaed4\', \'multiverseId\': 188099}, \'multiverseid\': 188099}, {\'name\': \'Ткач Джунглей\', \'text\': \'Захват (Этот объект может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Паутины ткачей ограждают территорию надежнее любой железной решетки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a00083-f646-4425-9c85-6c959cec4519\', \'multiverseId\': 188846}, \'multiverseid\': 188846}, {\'name\': \'丛林编网蛛\', \'text\': \'延势 （它能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n循环{2} （{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'编网蛛的网将地面分隔成许多区域，比钢铁铸造的闸门还要有效。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d1780e-dc56-4b3b-b8b1-d5efa21368e8\', \'multiverseId\': 187352}, \'multiverseid\': 187352}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187697&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04e7e282-7e4a-4ffa-9d0c-248d44b79387', 'multiverseId': 187697}, 'multiverseid': 187697}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187946&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '281dfc9d-d6fc-43b9-99bf-ea653b77ac69', 'multiverseId': 187946}, 'multiverseid': 187946}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188693&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4aa7bc8d-e024-45b8-a50b-befe1d000fdc', 'multiverseId': 188693}, 'multiverseid': 188693}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188444&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31d42b9e-2008-48a1-baaf-513b4d297b14', 'multiverseId': 188444}, 'multiverseid': 188444}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=187199&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05d75389-cf06-4287-b0a9-c5353d824ff4', 'multiverseId': 187199}, 'multiverseid': 187199}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=188195&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c16ae48-ebd0-4a64-bb94-42ac0d4dd716', 'multiverseId': 188195}, 'multiverseid': 188195}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer